gest?','mcq','[\"The Adjacent Side\", \"The Opposite Side\", \"The Hypotenuse\", \"The side next to the angle of reference\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 11:47:29.010000','64a5ab1b9a8e4be3b8592d4fcbf8f20d'),('089ba8e41bf347b99542dc854eaba0ac','Which of the following best describes a controlled component in React?','mcq','[\"A component whose state is managed by the DOM.\", \"A component whose form data is handled by the component\'s state.\", \"A component that doesn\'t require event handlers.\", \"A component that always uses refs to access form data.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 14:09:04.071000','054996bcd52b4ea6ad6b317b806a8876'),('08d55f3e7faa4810bb5452e435d139ab','A company wants to build a system that can automatically categorize incoming customer emails into predefined categories like \"billing inquiry,\" \"technical support,\" or \"product feedback.\" Which aspect of supervised learning makes it particularly suitable for this task?','mcq','[\"Its ability to learn from unlabeled data.\", \"Its reliance on intricate rule-based systems.\", \"Its capability to learn a mapping function from input features (email content) to output labels (categories) using historical labeled data.\", \"Its primary use for generating new, synthetic data.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.904000','b99b3658c8984ce3953c7fd44551e55a'),('0950c77868a9476e82ac075c26138d3c','Which data structures are particularly well-suited for recursive algorithms?','mcq','[\"Arrays and Linked Lists\", \"Trees and Graphs\", \"Stacks and Queues\", \"Hash Tables and Dictionaries\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 13:38:42.655000','5f5d663ebc1c41a09d5358077451ffb4'),('095941fd47754f87ae358212191eea15','Which of the following is an example of a \"side effect\" that the `useEffect` Hook enables functional components to perform?','mcq','[\"Managing internal component state.\", \"Declaring a new functional component.\", \"Data fetching.\", \"Changing component props.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 13:12:16.932000','c07d62f459584f95ae7f68eeb706d841'),('096fd1fc840e4784a4ae067a7396a479','According to the text, one critical reason for evaluating unsupervised models is to ensure \"meaningful insights.\" What does this specifically mean in the context of the provided example of customer segmentation?','mcq','[\"That the customer segments are easy to visualize.\", \"That the customer segments are distinct and actionable.\", \"That the customer segments contain an equal number of customers.\", \"That the customer segments can be used for supervised classification.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 10:48:52.086000','35d3b7ac1bb4457f9756b22f76c4f8bc'),('0a00cb4c6b0741fe998b59457746f770','What is the primary purpose of a \"base case\" in a recursive function?','mcq','[\"To define the initial input parameters for the function.\", \"To handle errors and exceptions during execution.\", \"To specify the condition that stops the recursion.\", \"To combine the solutions of sub-problems.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 20:44:51.928000','c72e8a9a30bd47a498960cf602d6731a'),('0a88cad6f0d5406a989ea6716a1d9415','What is the purpose of the constant of integration (C) when solving differential equations?','mcq','[\"It represents the initial condition of the system.\", \"It accounts for the family of solutions that satisfy the equation.\", \"It is a scaling factor for the solution.\", \"It is always equal to zero.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 16:43:13.364000','1705d496895a4360a920019413ccd5ea'),('0aeaec8c00e8494f90b8ff732fcce12e','What is the primary purpose of trigonometry?','mcq','[\"To solve complex algebraic equations\", \"To understand the relationships between angles and distances in triangles\", \"To calculate the area and perimeter of any shape\", \"To analyze statistical data\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 17:13:00.755000','ec8c5d77f1ac42f18d533aae54fe426f'),('0aee6ad844634f3b9d8fbbef65d8f0ea','What is the 1% rule in risk management?','mcq','[\"Never risk more than 1% of your total trading capital on a single trade.\", \"Always aim for a 1% profit on every trade.\", \"Allocate 1% of your portfolio to high-risk assets.\", \"Withdraw 1% of your profits after each successful trade.\"]','0',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 12:49:20.703000','64ef23a989fb4375a15a84f4bdd8372f'),('0af28692c1224a439f245ed6d326d9a7','If your trading capital is $5,000 and you adhere to the 1% rule, what is your maximum allowable risk per trade?','mcq','[\"$5\", \"$50\", \"$500\", \"$5,000\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 12:49:20.704000','64ef23a989fb4375a15a84f4bdd8372f'),('0be83b1bf6a24181869b9176831137e9','What does the acronym SOH CAH TOA help you remember?','mcq','[\"The names of famous mathematicians\", \"The definitions of sine, cosine, and tangent\", \"The angles of a right-angled triangle\", \"The types of triangles\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 17:50:02.047000','1204664ce0cf410fa019d5ce76bdd3fe'),('0caed78d6f02402d9abb4d6ed215bec8','What is the primary purpose of trigonometry?','mcq','[\"To calculate the area of any shape.\", \"To study the relationships between angles and sides of triangles.\", \"To solve complex algebraic equations.\", \"To analyze statistical data.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 17:50:02.020000','fe4efbc6863140e78ee5a58caeec2300'),('0cf64bda29694191bc90c6e679bb946a','What is the primary purpose of a trading plan?','mcq','[\"To guarantee profits in the financial markets\", \"To provide structure and direction for trading activities, minimizing emotional decisions\", \"To eliminate the need for market analysis\", \"To predict future market movements with certainty\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 12:49:20.700000','64ef23a989fb4375a15a84f4bdd8372f'),('0cfa2b8479714557b31124f14f921b0b','A slope field provides a visual representation of which of the following?','mcq','[\"The integral of a function.\", \"The solutions to a differential equation.\", \"The derivative of a function at a single point.\", \"The concavity of a function.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-23 06:07:32.227000','6cead2cbee80