d transform variables.\", \"The automated process of filling in missing values.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.991000','3921f356c51641d498226e1711b0788c'),('10a06758dee947f4b77c8a965c55ee4a','What is the sum of the angles in any triangle?','mcq','[\"90 degrees\", \"180 degrees\", \"360 degrees\", \"Varies depending on the triangle\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 12:14:15.505000','789aaa2c6bd04939bfec2358b491d7bd'),('10f28c40cea14285a9f4f7691ec62f11','In the RL circuit equation $L * (di/dt) + R * i = V(t)$, what does $V(t)$ represent?','mcq','[\"The inductance of the circuit.\", \"The resistance of the circuit.\", \"The current in the circuit.\", \"The applied voltage to the circuit.\"]','3',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 17:24:08.292000','f88ff020fc0841afb824fcd12e89ec32'),('11468ec2b402486ebb889432b50117ba','Given that y1(x) = e^x and y2(x) = e^-x are solutions to a second-order linear homogeneous differential equation, which of the following is also a solution?','mcq','[\"2e^x - e^-x\", \"e^(2x)\", \"e^x * e^-x\", \"sin(x)\"]','0',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 17:45:26.459000','d6ad787af2134dd9a68c5151dbc2fb0e'),('116fff75818546238a3cdf77e6a79193','What is the primary purpose of dimensionality reduction techniques in unsupervised learning, such as Principal Component Analysis (PCA)?','mcq','[\"To increase the number of features for better model performance.\", \"To label unlabeled data points automatically.\", \"To reduce the number of features while preserving important information.\", \"To predict future values based on historical data.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:39:10.068000','9cde90230c2144f3b248f5e23a6210fc'),('11902e5e82b34701876a3f24c4e7b0b8','Which of the following best describes the \"revolutionary\" aspect of Machine Learning mentioned in the text?','mcq','[\"Its ability to replace all human jobs.\", \"Its reliance on explicit programming for complex tasks.\", \"Its capacity for \\\"learning from experience\\\" through data.\", \"Its focus on creating machines tha