ion to its integrals.\", \"It relates a function to its derivatives.\", \"It relates a constant to its variables.\", \"It relates multiple variables to each other.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 12:02:46.217000','50571a7dda9a4dd1aca3a71be4848654'),('13c4dcddb1404595b30c282f9b2f7861','Which trigonometric ratio represents the relationship \"opposite / hypotenuse\"?','mcq','[\"Sine (sin)\", \"Cosine (cos)\", \"Tangent (tan)\", \"Cotangent (cot)\"]','0',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-23 06:16:19.357000','60f24830189145498064d7f46d832bbe'),('13ec0cc212e046b99ea0280e91f3f377','What does \"overfitting\" mean in the context of Machine Learning?','mcq','[\"The model is too simple and cannot capture the underlying patterns in the data.\", \"The model has learned the training data too well, including noise, and performs poorly on new, unseen data.\", \"The model has not been trained for a sufficient amount of time.\", \"The dataset used for training is too small.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:08:58.752000','005737eb395e4a7f9bc8b4e7fe4ccd49'),('145129eca52e4dda9c9fe2214004ed77','Which of the following is a valid solution to the differential equation dy/dx = 2x?','mcq','[\"y = x² + C\", \"y = 2x + C\", \"y = x²/2 + C\", \"y = √(2x) + C\"]','0',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-23 08:48:48.007000','1f18f64e112649719b909fe2cd809757'),('145c3757297e42cbb42360d468d95001','Let W1 and W2 be subspaces of a vector space V.  Under what condition is W1 ∪ W2 also a subspace?','mcq','[\"Always\", \"Never\", \"When W1 is a subset of W2 or W2 is a subset of W1.\", \"When W1 and W2 are orthogonal.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 13:04:13.113000','d0c51f8abe2d430ea608e3febc1f251e'),('14e02354401b47058fe8fa3476959b6d','Why is understanding strings described as \"crucial\" in software development?','mcq','[\"They are only used for advanced network protocols.\", \"They are the primary way programs interact with and represent human-readable information.\", \"They are exclusively for storing binary data.\", \"They are a rarely use