hey are defined once and never change.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 14:13:35.456000','1249b9ae5a314fa18d98c4ffb3cee778'),('1e9188efc8824c9183ac1a95d36a378a','What is the defining characteristic of a right triangle?','mcq','[\"All three angles are equal.\", \"It contains one angle that measures exactly 90 degrees.\", \"All sides are of equal length.\", \"It has no angles greater than 45 degrees.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 12:07:50.556000','670b202c2b2c48afb3656a5d17357b9f'),('1f5f2f6010d74e78a3ace5fae1ed0277','What is the defining characteristic of a right triangle?','mcq','[\"All its angles are acute.\", \"It has one angle exactly equal to 90 degrees.\", \"All its sides are equal in length.\", \"It has two angles that are equal.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 13:06:29.629000','688bcdacc17b4a498892e9e76f9327ae'),('1fdba0581e8f4ad3af087972851fe413','In the speedometer analogy, what does the acceleration represent?','mcq','[\"The car\'s position on the road.\", \"The reading on the speedometer.\", \"How quickly the speedometer needle is moving.\", \"The total distance traveled by the car.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 17:12:08.399000','0c9341197cf04a2ca651caba9cadd47d'),('1ff72e23685945b2a738989e062faf06','Which of the following is NOT a potential consequence of a cyberattack for businesses?','mcq','[\"Financial losses\", \"Reputational damage\", \"Increased customer trust\", \"Operational disruption\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 13:19:18.126000','a47931f317a04af0a9f546c8832276bb'),('20863a405eb04e8c87203ea2590289ff','What is JSX in React?','mcq','[\"A JavaScript library for styling components.\", \"A syntax extension that allows HTML-like code within JavaScript.\", \"A separate templating language used alongside React.\", \"A build tool for compiling React applications.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 14:09:04.048000','381e311fe1d94e7f976083a8fefde1c3'),('21674445c23041f3aa4a612d5e409381','How is 1 radian defined?','mcq','[\"The angle formed by an arc length equal to 360 degrees.\", \"The angle formed when the diameter of a circle is wrapped around its circumference.\", \"The angle formed by an arc length equal to the circle\'s radius.\", \"The angle that measures exactly 1 degree.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 11:51:31.733000','759235b9d57a406fb2d43c1b09ddb086'),('21bcde149b6b4306879a9c08219f97f9','Which of the following is NOT mentioned in the guide as something ODEs can model?','mcq','[\"The spread of a disease.\", \"The trajectory of a rocket.\", \"The cooling of your coffee.\", \"The fixed dimensions of a building.\"]','3',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 08:37:59.906000','cc3ca817ed7b4e68ab1e5a4f753082ce'),('22157304854749f49e44e8644431694b','What is the order of the differential equation $d^3y/dx^3 + 2(d^2y/dx^2) - dy/dx + 5y = sin(x)$?','mcq','[\"1\", \"2\", \"3\", \"4\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 13:34:31.223000','c2bc3a63f44e4f3cac4c98155de6e633'),('2248410a50da49bcaa32cca028f1210a','What is a hash collision?','mcq','[\"When two different hash functions produce the same output.\", \"When two different keys produce the same hash value.\", \"When a key is deleted from the dictionary.\", \"When a value is updated in the dictionary.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 08:07:04.362000','a5e342692eee4cfda23903ede3e64633'),('228c333188664622be889c3d96a65573','According to the text, what kind of dynamic behavior do second-order linear differential equations primarily describe?','mcq','[\"Systems that only depend on their current state.\", \"Systems where only the rate of change matters.\", \"Systems involving oscillations, acceleration, and the rate of change of the rate of change.\", \"Systems with no external forces or inputs.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 04:41:36.844000','7feca3919c2941448945bfb2f9d8fa74'),('229802da454d4916a338b5787d73856d','What was a primary characteristic of early AI research, often referred to as Symbolic AI or GOFAI?','mcq','[\"It relied heavily on vast datasets and powerful computational resources.\", \"It focused on programming explicit rules and knowledge into systems.\", \"It primarily utilized Machine Learning and Deep Learning techniques.\", \"It aimed to build intelligent agents that could sense their environment without pre-programmed rules.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 21:10:58.605000','b1552691ac364cc88e4de71e1814eae0'),('23a6ee70cc9a430fa5598f9cc5489341','What will be the output of the following code snippet?','mcq','[\"x is greater than 10\", \"x is greater than 2\", \"x is not greater than 2\", \"The code will produce an error.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 12:31:23.174000','609e62c4599b43e29464501f09cf967f'),('23c96eb2fd5843bcb05e4d0bec3881e3','In most programming languages, what is the index of the first element in an array?','mcq','[\"1\", \"-1\", \"0\", \"The size of the array minus 1\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 21:42:25.673000','3261c532d2f2404a93b1bcbe57a081c7'),('23df9680c9e8417a9b4deb482abae290','In a right triangle, which side is always the longest and is directly across from the 90-degree angle?','mcq','[\"The Adjacent Side\", \"The Opposite Side\", \"The Hypotenuse\", \"The Base\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 17:01:49.734000','a7fb522bd62546d9b06810a8c5579b76'),('2420fb6f05e9466fb4eb5b6ea1d6fd36','What is the primary goal of cybersecurity?','mcq','[\"To prevent physical theft of computer hardware.\", \"To protect computer systems and networks from unauthorized access and malicious activities.\", \"To ensure all software is free and open-source.\", \"To promote the ethical use of the internet.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 13:19:18.126000','a47931f317a04af0a9f546c8832276bb'),('2485db4888df47edabc329f28476b845','According to the text, what is a primary reason First-Order Differential Equations are indispensable?','mcq','[\"They describe static snapshots of systems.\", \"They provide exact future states without calculation.\", \"They model systems where the rate of change depends on the quantity itself, time, or both.\", \"They are only used in theoretical mathematics, not real-world scenarios.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.198000','826bbc0263b34345b167ee6f0d969cab'),('24b852f4efb14c588e1d514275701198','In the analogy provided, if a component is a \"small, specialized machine,\" what do \"Props\" represent?','mcq','[\"The internal memory or current working data of the machine.\", \"The tasks the machine performs.\", \"The configuration settings or ingredients fed into the machine from the outside.\", \"The output generated by the machine.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 13:12:16.853000','ff8aac3e77954f00aa8104edb373050c'),('24dfc225ff204ce09a05ee219213babd','What is the role of the Java Virtual Machine (JVM)?','mcq','[\"Compiling Java source code into bytecode.\", \"Executing compiled Java bytecode.\", \"Writing Java source code.\", \"Debugging Java applications.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 12:31:23.092000','961e66a1e4ff4e7a991efd2928be8e0e'),('24fe9efcca0e4fcaa893db57dd80384e','If you separate variables in the differential equation `(dy/dx) = (x² + 1)/y`, what is the resulting equation before integration?','mcq','[\"`y dy = (x² + 1) dx`\", \"`dx = (x² + 1)/y dy`\", \"`dy = (x² + 1)/y dx`\", \"`y dx = (x² + 1) dy`\"]','0',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 13:19:34.354000','8001722283f94973ab127efc202fd8d0'),('250d4d5c2a0949b286ddf174d26d0174','In the provided factorial function, what is the recursive step?','mcq','[\"`if (n == 0)`\", \"`return 1;`\", \"`return n * factorial(n-1);`\", \"`int factorial(int n)`\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 15:28:24.299000','51b49eec339f486a8bbecd4cb6f16e74'),('257d8d7a8ea040b7a4fde6600ed108d4','You buy a bond with a face value of $1,000 and a 6% annual interest rate. How much interest will you receive each year?','mcq','[\"$60\", \"$600\", \"$1,060\", \"$6\"]','0',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 12:49:20.585000','34a3b54141064b28bed319d51e22ff57'),('25f18a920c0b4c3784df6bc6ffd40f71','Which fundamental mathematical concepts are mentioned as prerequisites for navigating the realm of differential equations?','mcq','[\"Linear algebra and discrete mathematics.\", \"Statistics and probability theory.\", \"Derivatives and integrals from calculus.\", \"Geometry and trigonometry.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:11:14.272000','aae4ce9acb1c4afeba814726a675d550'),('25f8d89a3f3c4c2aae8ddf491203f6c7','What does the mnemonic \"SOH\" stand for in \"SOH CAH TOA\"?','mcq','[\"Sine is Opposite over Adjacent\", \"Sine is Hypotenuse over Opposite\", \"Sine is Opposite over Hypotenuse\", \"Sine is Adjacent over Hypotenuse\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 17:35:46.463000','b298dd3e50bb47e39dba43cb30885b13'),('262117cb16704b87be22c0caa8dae85d','Which method is commonly used to solve first-order differential equations where the variables can be isolated on each side of the equation?','mcq','[\"Integration by parts\", \"Substitution\", \"Separation of variables\", \"Partial fractions\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 12:45:57.173000','dba019f0d4bd4724b08c1b38d4ab94b3'),('2665c28aa1484ee9b3eb7da060a5055e','Which of the following is a defining characteristic of a \"linear\" differential equation according to the text?','mcq','[\"The equation contains only constant terms.\", \"The dependent variable and its derivatives appear only to the first power and are not multiplied together.\", \"The equation describes a straight line when plotted.\", \"The highest derivative is of the first order.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:49:32.366000','fba23063a68e489597f13e5b2c5a974d'),('267742e32259449487183f2b429b90f3','What is the sine of an angle in a right triangle?','mcq','[\"Adjacent side / Hypotenuse\", \"Opposite side / Hypotenuse\", \"Opposite side / Adjacent side\", \"Hypotenuse / Opposite side\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 17:50:02.031000','fe4efbc6863140e78ee5a58caeec2300'),('26d293a51b7948a5a81fe9a91c467982','In a right-angled triangle, what is the name of the side opposite the right angle?','mcq','[\"Adjacent\", \"Opposite\", \"Hypotenuse\", \"Base\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 14:05:47.898000','54957642a32b4613a47f455c32225581'),('26f3998698cb497ab4e72afd61838839','The Laplace Transform converts a function of a real variable \'t\' (often time) into a function of which complex variable?','mcq','[\"x (space)\", \"y (amplitude)\", \"s (frequency)\", \"z (impedance)\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.379000','580ab48eb18e4e8baee457a0401cc668'),('270ab2084fd44175b8fec7bd99bbe5d4','What is a \"neuron\" in the context of neural networks?','mcq','[\"A biological nerve cell\", \"The basic unit of a neural network, also called a node\", \"A type of activation function\", \"A layer in a neural network\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 15:06:39.373000','0c2ac4e5145a4246b60adf0eec649060'),('2790a4ad3e0d4cc8bebb3fabe00ec76a','Which of the following examples would be classified as a first-order differential equation based on the provided text?','mcq','[\"An equation involving $d^2y/dx^2$.\", \"An equation involving $dy/dx$ as its highest derivative.\", \"An equation that only contains $y$ and $x$ without derivatives.\", \"An equation that describes the movement of planets without derivatives.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 06:06:31.972000','bc9b67b14734495d92587aaa9e3f597e'),('27a95bf3f36549478db4cea0bbaa0e46','What is a key difference between long-term investing and short-term trading?','mcq','[\"Long-term investing involves higher risks than short-term trading.\", \"Long-term investing focuses on holding assets for extended periods, while short-term trading involves frequent buying and selling.\", \"Long-term investing is only suitable for experienced traders.\", \"Long-term investing requires a larger initial investment than short-term trading.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 12:49:20.739000','5ef9526ec04b41eb97dc2639b1f6c145'),('27ab8724dde74eecbbf83efbc78fd198','What does the term \"First-Order\" signify in a First-Order Ordinary Differential Equation?','mcq','[\"The equation is the simplest type of differential equation.\", \"The unknown function appears only once.\", \"The highest derivative present in the equation is the first derivative.\", \"The equation can only be solved using integration.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:12:08.148000','90d62550c0d54237947475f5e801a6f6'),('2837d7a85db1432896a166782da3686e','What is the constant in the expression $4y^2 - 2y + 7$?','mcq','[\"$4$\", \"$y$\", \"$7$\", \"$-2$\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 06:18:02.847000','0e74a26ce69a4a04a6c7821b6d4b3286'),('2997c2642fa54bed85a0887e40c6efe2','If the growth rate \'k\' in the population equation were negative, what would this signify?','mcq','[\"The population is growing very rapidly.\", \"The population is constant.\", \"The population is declining.\", \"The initial population is zero.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 12:43:33.208000','cc36eeb508fb4a23ab995c460d644a32'),('29f12192a3a34a64b47c01ea73e8abec','According to the content, what capability does the `useState` Hook provide to functional components?','mcq','[\"Performing \\\"side effects\\\" like data fetching.\", \"Managing and updating their own internal state.\", \"Interacting with the outside world directly.\", \"Defining custom lifecycle methods.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 13:12:16.931000','c07d62f459584f95ae7f68eeb706d841'),('2a25e32ea35a46d1bf4f037c69074faf','What is the constant term in the polynomial $x^4 + 3x^2 - 7$?','mcq','[\"$1$\", \"$3$\", \"$-7$\", \"$0$\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 14:51:16.892000','fcfdc8e00d5e493c9ace254e9e6c56e1'),('2a7618d8650f4cc28b5bb783381dc7d6','According to the learning guide, what is one primary use of polynomials?','mcq','[\"Solving complex equations with only constants.\", \"Modeling real-world phenomena like financial growth and bridge shapes.\", \"Representing numbers in binary code.\", \"Calculating the speed of light.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 06:18:02.947000','1891ba1adea14fdebd57c80404547e90'),('2b10fed7c99a423ca08b48909a0b672f','Which of the following are common examples of independent variables in a Partial Differential Equation (PDE)?','mcq','[\"The unknown function u or phi.\", \"Temperature and pressure.\", \"Spatial coordinates (x, y, z) and time (t).\", \"The order and linearity of the equation.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.389000','d827e24d6d5c426f8c2d0441ba7f6229'),('2b1818238143470fa6587bf9d65b7284','What is considered a \"solution\" to a differential equation?','mcq','[\"A specific numerical value for the independent variable.\", \"A function that, when substituted into the equation, satisfies it.\", \"A constant that makes the equation true.\", \"The highest order of derivative present in the equation.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.189000','12ccb3a0ccfa41d689a7f515d7cb1db7'),('2b3f8e2559734b8d8ec9c9eeb04ca0fb','Why are arrays considered efficient for data retrieval?','mcq','[\"They store data in a random order, allowing for quick searches.\", \"They use complex algorithms to locate elements.\", \"They allow direct access to elements using their index, providing constant time complexity (O(1)).\", \"They store only small amounts of data, making retrieval fast.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 15:37:06.675000','dd5923b5fc0f4f349c305bbe0bb7ffc4'),('2b542a5e4c174e21b91a24637dd3a748','What is the primary benefit of using Laplace Transforms to solve Ordinary Differential Equations (ODEs)?','mcq','[\"They eliminate the need for initial conditions.\", \"They convert tough calculus problems into straightforward algebra problems.\", \"They only work for linear ODEs.\", \"They provide solutions only in the s-domain.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.363000','8b3c58d12b724867ae015fc22480e682'),('2b70da972a3c42f28ab521c2442dce91','What is malware?','mcq','[\"A type of hardware designed to protect against viruses.\", \"Malicious software designed to damage or disable computer systems.\", \"A secure network protocol.\", \"A type of encryption algorithm.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 13:19:18.128000','a47931f317a04af0a9f546c8832276bb'),('2b9334101e2646abbd713c1781679a24','What is the primary difference between a tree and a graph data structure?','mcq','[\"Trees are used for hierarchical data, while graphs are used for interconnected data.\", \"Trees can only represent a limited number of nodes, while graphs can represent an unlimited number.\", \"Trees cannot have cycles, while graphs can.\", \"Trees are more efficient for searching than graphs.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 15:12:29.194000','b14f3b06fb69491690f18b541457cbd3'),('2c0de99b57a84422a15663a69875aab2','The text mentions that all elements in an array are typically of the same data type. What is a key benefit of this characteristic in the context of arrays?','mcq','[\"It allows for flexible storage of various data types within the same array.\", \"It simplifies memory management and ensures a predictable, uniform size for each element, aiding contiguous storage.\", \"It enables elements to be stored non-contiguously, improving flexibility.\", \"It prevents any element from being modified after creation.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 20:44:51.810000','560d5101bf2c44239f01516875752912'),('2c41fc082f8942c1bd55082565ad784f','Which term describes the numerical position of an element within an array or string?','mcq','[\"Length\", \"Size\", \"Index\", \"Element\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 15:12:29.111000','fdea55712a3b4cad965bef691bfac247'),('2c42be114fd4416c985daeab295b8ee4','What is the key difference between declaring a variable with `let` versus `const`?','mcq','[\"`let` variables are global, while `const` variables are local.\", \"`let` allows the variable\'s value to be reassigned, while `const` declares a constant whose value cannot be reassigned.\", \"`const` variables can only store `number` data types, while `let` can store any type.\", \"`let` is an older keyword, while `const` is modern.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 13:25:59.716000','b5632b45519049c494b634084e77c2a8'),('2c7d0a5918c849399d39eb60cce29db9','Which data structure is commonly associated with recursive algorithms?','mcq','[\"Arrays\", \"Queues\", \"Trees\", \"Linked Lists\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 15:28:24.297000','51b49eec339f486a8bbecd4cb6f16e74'),('2c9cf3159e4d456ba941770a781fa811','Which of the following is a separable first-order differential equation?','mcq','[\"$dy/dx = x + y$\", \"$dy/dx = x * y^2$\", \"$dy/dx + xy = sin(x)$\", \"$dy/dx = x/y + y/x$\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 17:42:08.621000','07ab4b72c08c4ba4b53ba1522c72adeb'),('2ca3667760f9480f85130b2b7c09b382','Which of the following is NOT listed as an example of enhanced application capabilities powered by Machine Learning?','mcq','[\"Recommendation engines\", \"Spam filters\", \"Manual data entry\", \"Facial recognition\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:32:24.821000','f213854acc724d86bc6acb020bdf7237'),('2cb882cdbec2438e82b8fa74961df3a1','What is the fundamental characteristic of a differential equation, as described in the text?','mcq','[\"It always involves only constant numbers.\", \"It is an equation that involves an unknown function and one or more of its derivatives.\", \"It only solves for a simple numerical value, not a function.\", \"It never contains any variables, only constants.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.184000','12ccb3a0ccfa41d689a7f515d7cb1db7'),('2cd85e0811f34d009f908134bca61b7e','If sin(θ) = 0.8, what is the value of θ (approximately)?','mcq','[\"53 degrees\", \"39 degrees\", \"0.93 radians\", \"1.45 radians\"]','0',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 17:13:00.893000','1a4dbeeb018746cf974c6d060517a63e'),('2d01ee3ce4ca46d98ff123e8ebbb8f0b','Which of the following represents the general form of a second-order linear ODE?','mcq','[\"`a(x)y\' + b(x)y = f(x)`\", \"`a(x)y\'\' + b(x)y\' + c(x)y = f(x)`\", \"`ay\'\' + by\' + cy = f(x)`\", \"`y\'\' + y\' + y = 0`\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 06:06:32.051000','181a2e4216dc40c4a57a9cfc7cc5dc60'),('2d6c087fe3b744e1b74afc67f2efdcbe','How do second-order ODEs primarily differ from first-order ODEs, as described in the text?','mcq','[\"First-order ODEs have constant coefficients, while second-order ODEs do not.\", \"Second-order ODEs describe rates of change, while first-order ODEs describe acceleration.\", \"Second-order ODEs involve the rate of change of the rate of change, unlike first-order ODEs which describe only rates of change.\", \"First-order ODEs have an `f(x)` term, while second-order ODEs do not.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 04:41:36.846000','7feca3919c2941448945bfb2f9d8fa74'),('2dfee25a43f34c5a8466205fbd0f3b16','In a right triangle, an angle measures 30 degrees. If the hypotenuse is 10 units long, what is the length of the side opposite the 30-degree angle?','mcq','[\"10√3 units\", \"5√3 units\", \"5 units\", \"10 units\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 04:26:47.887000','cc870eabbfd240c89ac6408848cb520a'),('2e9eab10f08e4edeaf2b57c8074e4b6f','According to the learning guide, what is the primary purpose of right triangle trigonometry?','mcq','[\"To calculate the area of any type of triangle.\", \"To solve for unknown sides or angles in triangles that contain a 90-degree angle.\", \"To determine if a triangle is equilateral or isosceles.\", \"To measure the perimeter of irregular polygons.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 05:26:23.203000','7e79ee02067c4d7184d89acf0869ffd2'),('2ea00b5a408340a897477dd87857a663','What is a string in most programming languages?','mcq','[\"A single character.\", \"A sequence of characters.\", \"A numerical value.\", \"A boolean value.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 21:37:20.300000','043c6b11563b4934a5d5bb8d5e2541be'),('2f8091e7b2314717bb7509ff602d7f6c','What does a slope field represent visually?','mcq','[\"The solution curve of a differential equation.\", \"The direction of change of the solution at different points.\", \"The integral of the differential equation.\", \"The area under the solution curve.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 16:43:13.358000','1705d496895a4360a920019413ccd5ea'),('30af421657494d82b54ad3a1ce877f0e','What is the Virtual DOM in React?','mcq','[\"A simplified version of HTML\", \"A lightweight copy of the actual