ize data from a population.\", \"To draw conclusions about a population based on a sample.\", \"To visualize data using charts and graphs.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 16:35:28.518000','eb2488304b174a7abb73e58e9bcc692b'),('319aac29e90e4f3493e1426686c5a4a3','What is the first step in solving the differential equation dy/dx = xy using separation of variables?','mcq','[\"Integrate both sides with respect to x\", \"Rewrite the equation as dy/y = x dx\", \"Substitute a test solution\", \"Determine the order of the equation\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-23 08:48:48.009000','1f18f64e112649719b909fe2cd809757'),('31de7ff5f11a4150adce37edeca708e9','What type of attack involves injecting malicious scripts into websites viewed by other users?','mcq','[\"SQL Injection\", \"Cross-Site Scripting (XSS)\", \"Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF)\", \"Session Hijacking\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 13:32:44.464000','187d9618da144e5bbabac4a3c83dde0d'),('320052a698ba40509b776dbbc79bc5dd','What is the primary purpose of solving an algebraic equation?','mcq','[\"To simplify the equation\", \"To determine the value of the variable that satisfies the equation\", \"To rewrite the equation using different variables\", \"To create a visual representation of the equation\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 14:23:28.130000','9e5e978f79e9442b9f5b6e8040e0cffb'),('322b5cdf4a724e08a2ee1ea39037a8be','What is the purpose of the `swapped` flag in the provided Bubble Sort code?','mcq','[\"To count the number of swaps performed.\", \"To indicate whether the array is already sorted.\", \"To terminate the inner loop early if no swaps occur in a pass.\", \"To reverse the sorting order.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 15:12:29.247000','8d084366378c421d866add59f6217fef'),('328470c0cf9940e5b2effbed1029d8da','What is the primary purpose of control flow statements in Java?','mcq','[\"To define data types and variables.\", \"To dictate the order in which statements are executed.\", \"To perform mathematical calculations.\", \"To handle user input and output.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 12:31:23.170000','609e62c4599b43e29464501f09cf967f'),('329667a2ea134af9b8a5142d1185d5b5','In the context of Ordinary Differential Equations (ODEs), what does the term \"ordinary\" signify?','mcq','[\"The equation is simple to solve.\", \"It involves only one independent variable.\", \"It describes common, everyday phenomena.\", \"It does not involve partial derivatives.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.176000','39e47832557e4d669ee13501cc74066a'),('329b998268004f49ab56c76dcdd52565','What does SOH CAH TOA stand for?','mcq','[\"Sine = Opposite/Hypotenuse, Cosine = Adjacent/Opposite, Tangent = Opposite/Adjacent\", \"Sine = Opposite/Hypotenuse, Cosine = Adjacent/Hypotenuse, Tangent = Opposite/Adjacent\", \"Sine = Adjacent/Hypotenuse, Cosine = Opposite/Hypotenuse, Tangent = Adjacent/Opposite\", \"Sine = Opposite/Adjacent, Cosine = Adjacent/Hypotenuse, Tangent = Opposite/Hypotenuse\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 17:13:00.878000','1a4dbeeb018746cf974c6d060517a63e'),('3305b9d0e2454ef5bf2bb41a5bfed465','What is the primary characteristic of supervised learning?','mcq','[\"It uses unlabeled data to find hidden patterns.\", \"It learns from data that has been tagged with the correct output.\", \"It involves an agent learning through trial and error in an environment.\", \"It focuses on reducing the dimensionality of data.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 11:08:58.889000','f1f9d979a3d34273af69fef0281854c9'),('330a2699018e45bab615f25c09d055bb','How do JFETs differ from Bipolar Junction Transistors (BJTs) in terms of their control mechanism?','mcq','[\"JFETs are current-controlled, while BJTs are voltage-controlled.\", \"JFETs are voltage-controlled, while BJTs are current-controlled.\", \"Both JFETs and BJTs are voltage-controlled.\", \"Both JFETs and BJTs are current-controlled.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 05:22:59.009000','2aa1d720ac864a3bb798f0c0054bbd65'),('33237fe5b48a4e41bed496d38389e81d','What specific error is mentioned as a consequence of a recursive function lacking a base case?','mcq','[\"Syntax error\", \"Memory leak\", \"Stack overflow error\", \"Type mismatch error\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 20:29:21.211000','2c012df388404db79dc0a79a2e4ee05c'),('332d0060a444446286b672c486875b81','According to the text, what is the main benefit the Laplace Transform offers when solving Systems of ODEs?','mcq','[\"It converts algebraic operations into differential operations.\", \"It transforms functions of a complex frequency variable into functions of time.\", \"It converts differential operations in the t-domain into algebraic operations in the s-domain.\", \"It simplifies the process of finding particular solutions without initial conditions.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.313000','583e36786da64bb99b44aa4d9069ac7a'),('3368637a873c434cbe370437618fd214','In a right-angled triangle, the adjacent side is 4 units long, and the hypotenuse is 5 units long. What is the cosine of the angle between the adjacent side and the hypotenuse?','mcq','[\"0.6\", \"0.8\", \"1.25\", \"0.75\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 17:13:00.898000','1a4dbeeb018746cf974c6d060517a63e'),('3398faded3504abb8bf30f4d9cb95f2f','In any right triangle, which side is always the longest?','mcq','[\"The Opposite side\", \"The Adjacent side\", \"The Hypotenuse\", \"The 90-degree side\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 11:58:55.651000','03df8683f297479395dcaaa941564c91'),('33fb6327c176493b857432a5e1b483c3','What does the mnemonic SOH stand for in SOH CAH TOA?','mcq','[\"Sine equals Opposite over Hypotenuse\", \"Sine equals Adjacent over Hypotenuse\", \"Sine equals Opposite over Adjacent\", \"Sine equals Hypotenuse over Opposite\"]','0',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-25 12:42:57.056000','07f8a87141fb47e98c45a1cdc2fb8d78'),('342915075efa4e06a83f10547d494bf9','What is the purpose of declaring a variable in Java?','mcq','[\"To reserve a space in memory to hold a value of a specific type.\", \"To perform complex mathematical calculations.\", \"To define a new function.\", \"To import external libraries.\"]','0',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 12:31:23.135000','4679e462f35b40e08c578efa370887dc'),('343e2ee874904ee9a3a97c647dbcafdf','What does the tangent function (tan) represent in a right triangle?','mcq','[\"adjacent / hypotenuse\", \"opposite / hypotenuse\", \"opposite / adjacent\", \"hypotenuse / adjacent\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 13:40:19.985000','d65f0f8a25284e4aa6d45c3e9be97f09'),('3454cbbcae6b4b4fa386396ac2d9132d','What type of exponents must variables in a polynomial term have?','mcq','[\"Any real number.\", \"Negative integers only.\", \"Non-negative integer exponents.\", \"Fractions or decimals.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 06:18:02.951000','1891ba1adea14fdebd57c80404547e90'),('3570c81ef709470e8885b4a9119937cf','In many programming languages (like Python, Java, C#), strings are considered \"immutable\". What does this mean?','mcq','[\"Their length cannot be determined.\", \"Their value cannot be changed after they are created.\", \"They can only contain numeric characters.\", \"They can be modified directly in place.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 08:30:36.871000','4224aa735f4949f2a11d85a5d97891b3'),('35d8fe4b4cfe482eb50fb1f5ace12ce5','What is the primary purpose of dimensionality reduction techniques?','mcq','[\"To increase the complexity of a dataset\", \"To improve the accuracy of supervised learning models\", \"To reduce the number of variables while preserving essential information\", \"To visualize data in one dimension\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 15:06:39.289000','90ad7864ca6b4b1db6ff1b8dc1f96401'),('35fe776b459946f0a8283014ece75279','According to the text, what is the primary purpose of differential equations?','mcq','[\"To solve for unknown variables in algebraic expressions.\", \"To describe and predict how things *change* over time or space.\", \"To calculate the area under a curve.\", \"To find the maximum or minimum values of a function.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:49:32.148000','239d0946419f