unctional components.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 14:13:35.462000','1249b9ae5a314fa18d98c4ffb3cee778'),('3a9982dd13144bd4a1221ee499a756be','If the non-homogeneous term `f(x)` in the equation `a y\'\' + b y\' + c y = f(x)` were equal to 0, what type of ODE would it become?','mcq','[\"A first-order ODE\", \"A homogeneous ODE\", \"A non-linear ODE\", \"A partial differential equation\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.314000','bf188003cab7489f994226630f178712'),('3aad1b64ea114f5a943763eb852d2158','In a right triangle, if the angle is 30 degrees and the adjacent side is 10, what trigonometric function would you use to find the opposite side?','mcq','[\"Cosine\", \"Sine\", \"Tangent\", \"Secant\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 17:50:02.029000','fe4efbc6863140e78ee5a58caeec2300'),('3b34148f20df4f50a7e9eced1dec02c4','What is the primary purpose of an indefinite integral?','mcq','[\"To find the instantaneous rate of change of a function.\", \"To calculate the area under a curve between two specific points.\", \"To determine the set of all antiderivatives of a function.\", \"To approximate the value of a definite integral.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 15:34:06.646000','b1c4db5fe5c34ede8ff07ebb13dba742'),('3b48638b4a9a424581fa5ae32a88130f','What does the term \"Linear\" signify in Systems of Linear Differential Equations, according to the text?','mcq','[\"The equations involve terms like y^2 or sin(y).\", \"The equations are always represented by straight lines on a graph.\", \"The equations do not have tricky terms like y^2, sin(y), or y * z.\", \"The equations only involve constants and no variables.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.501000','6e1f70b8f00c435c9146185cf9273095'),('3b4b55315fe041aca245c7b3b7bf830c','What is the purpose of the base case in a recursive function?','mcq','[\"To perform the main computation of the function.\", \"To call the function itself with a modified input.\", \"To prevent infinite recursion by providing a stopping condition.\", \"To initialize the variables used in the function.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 13:38:42.647000','5f5d663ebc1c41a09d5358077451ffb4'),('3ba5befede2248459b2720fc5ac4e399','Which of the following is an example of a first-order ordinary differential equation (ODE)?','mcq','[\"∂u/∂t = α (∂²u/∂x²)\", \"y\'\' + 4y = 0\", \"dy/dx = x² + y\", \"y\'\'\' - 2y\'\' + y\' = x\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 12:02:46.222000','50571a7dda9a4dd1aca3a71be4848654'),('3c1e1f8ee1964eb8b3f5a9ad209fc0ea','In a right triangle, which trigonometric ratio is defined as the length of the side opposite the angle divided by the length of the hypotenuse?','mcq','[\"Cosine\", \"Tangent\", \"Sine\", \"Secant\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 04:26:47.870000','cc870eabbfd240c89ac6408848cb520a'),('3c2210ecf03b4f4b9ae6c8762b621204','What does the \"H\" represent in the mnemonic SOH CAH TOA?','mcq','[\"Height\", \"Hypotenuse\", \"Hundred\", \"Helix\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-25 17:50:02.027000','fe4efbc6863140e78ee5a58caeec2300'),('3c91214ff3da4edf95255314894f01a4','What is a string literal in C++?','mcq','[\"A variable that stores a string.\", \"A sequence of characters enclosed in double quotes.\", \"A pointer to a character array.\", \"A method for comparing strings.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 13:35:25.083000','a3f6eb5159cc4b348a509d574032e3bc'),('3c933ec74c814673bdb2e3c956e35799','What is the defining characteristic of a right triangle?','mcq','[\"It has three equal sides.\", \"It contains one 90-degree angle.\", \"All its angles are acute.\", \"It has four sides.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 11:51:31.646000','1a3b7e637fb445fa9d533dc78e3a6ced'),('3d0cef163bed4fa685549d80a51f4975','According to the introduction, what is Right Triangle Trigonometry primarily described as?','mcq','[\"An abstract mathematical theory with no practical use.\", \"A method for drawing perfect triangles.\", \"A practical toolkit for solving real-world problems involving distances, heights, and angles.\", \"A way to identify the color of a triangle.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 17:01:49.737000','a7fb522bd62546d9b06810a8c5579b76'),('3d72a883a8184d2480ae04715c93bbbb','What is the main goal of a supervised learning model once it is trained?','mcq','[\"To generate new input features.\", \"To predict appropriate labels for new, unseen input data.\", \"To remove labels from existing datasets.\", \"To create a new labeled dataset from scratch.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.900000','b99b3658c8984ce3953c7fd44551e55a'),('3dab884d5b3342f89e5d8edd6de12f88','What is the primary goal of clustering algorithms in unsupervised learning?','mcq','[\"To predict the value of a target variable\", \"To group similar data points together based on their features\", \"To reduce the number of variables in a dataset\", \"To identify outliers in a dataset\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 15:06:39.285000','90ad7864ca6b4b1db6ff1b8dc1f96401'),('3e295bcb33ef410eb0d74442bbff25c7','What is the primary goal when solving an algebraic equation?','mcq','[\"To perform complex calculations\", \"To isolate the variable\", \"To balance the equation\", \"To substitute different values for the variable\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 16:15:26.915000','f3d61f8841654816a79fa1e5db46c1b3'),('3ea85d7273c34210b17d893c3679b4ea','When using the power series method, what is the assumed form of the solution `y(x)` centered at `x_0 = 0`?','mcq','[\"`y(x) = a_0 + a_1*x`\", \"`y(x) = sum from n=0 to infinity of a_n * x^n`\", \"`y(x) = a_n * x^n`\", \"`y(x) = sum from n=1 to infinity of n * a_n * x^(n-1)`\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 04:41:36.918000','ea2a1146356a492a93bd4a7e382ea9a5'),('3f16e3a5da9445388eae4cb2dc19093f','Which event handler is typically used to capture changes in an input field\'s value in a controlled component?','mcq','[\"`onSubmit`\", \"`onClick`\", \"`onChange`\", \"`onBlur`\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 14:09:04.078000','054996bcd52b4ea6ad6b317b806a8876'),('3f46947e9bc14e6894585019b14dfc79','Besides the Sun and planets, which other types of celestial objects are explicitly mentioned as components of our solar system?','mcq','[\"Galaxies, nebulae, and black holes.\", \"Other stars, quasars, and dark matter.\", \"Moons, asteroids, and comets.\", \"Supernovas, pulsars, and white dwarfs.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 06:34:38.391000','bdb724c12e6f4e8eba35f6ab62281883'),('4032febeac9940aabb848f0e86cb2de0','In the analogy of mailboxes for an array, what does the \"unique number\" for each mailbox represent?','mcq','[\"The data type of the element.\", \"The memory address of the array itself.\", \"The index of the element.\", \"The value stored within the element.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 21:02:18.991000','7f1db26bcb06449eb7da26f97f6ea148'),('41023cb45fb64c77b18d37ab78bf536d','A right triangle has legs of length 3 cm and 4 cm. What is the length of its hypotenuse?','mcq','[\"5 cm\", \"6 cm\", \"7 cm\", \"25 cm\"]','0',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 04:26:47.880000','cc870eabbfd240c89ac6408848cb520a'),('412b1acf7b6b4936aae754ed0347ebe1','The content states that Django Apps are \"designed to be reusable and can be plugged into different Django projects.\" What does this primarily imply about their design?','mcq','[\"Apps must contain their own database and user authentication system.\", \"Apps are built to be independent of specific project-level configurations and can function across various projects.\", \"Apps are only useful for very small, single-feature websites.\", \"Apps automatically handle all URL routing for the entire project.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 16:49:32.804000','ab9fc04dfb08474b81448a4cd33f8167'),('41e044e707c046a5b3ae55b4c81c9bee','Which type of differential equation involves functions of a single independent variable?','mcq','[\"Partial Differential Equation (PDE)\", \"Ordinary Differential Equation (ODE)\", \"Stochastic Differential Equation (SDE)\", \"Algebraic Differential Equation (ADE)\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 13:49:16.002000','2e3142476d1b40b581611bc6202c1484'),('41f50359b7c84da18