\", \"Tangent\", \"Sine\", \"Cotangent\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 12:59:54.621000','d74592981391499e8b878c8c93a28fcd'),('46eb40b0719b42509dc5aef20d777099','The text uses the analogy of building a \"sturdy house with poor quality, unorganized materials\" to illustrate the consequence of what in Machine Learning?','mcq','[\"Using an outdated machine learning framework.\", \"Skipping or inadequately performing the data preparation phase.\", \"Not having enough data for training.\", \"Choosing the wrong evaluation metric.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:39:09.868000','c442c409bf204cde89647871fea276a8'),('4740d826114a49cc9670df36fd6b9217','A ladder leans against a wall, forming a 30-degree angle with the ground. The ladder is 10 feet long. How far is the base of the ladder from the wall?','mcq','[\"5 feet\", \"8.66 feet\", \"10 feet\", \"11.55 feet\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 12:59:54.627000','d74592981391499e8b878c8c93a28fcd'),('47811fda861443d0902fd4d61d81af7c','You have a right-angled triangle with an angle of 60 degrees. The opposite side is 7 units long. Which trigonometric ratio would you use to find the length of the hypotenuse?','mcq','[\"Cosine\", \"Tangent\", \"Sine\", \"None of the above\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-25 17:13:00.889000','1a4dbeeb018746cf974c6d060517a63e'),('47ad9dd487c84fa6bb02a2cf3f0ecc6d','A software application that learns to identify fraudulent transactions by analyzing past transaction data, rather than being given a fixed set of rules for fraud, is primarily an example of which field?','mcq','[\"Traditional Programming\", \"Artificial Intelligence (AI)\", \"Machine Learning (ML)\", \"Natural Language Processing (NLP)\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 11:32:24.711000','dae1f871cc4d427b993184c73a30dc76'),('47bd8b8f23d246c7acb33c2863400497','What is the primary purpose of software updates?','mcq','[\"To add new features and improve performance.\", \"To patch security vulnerabilities and protect against threats.\", \"To consume more storage space 