ed list over an array when the size of the data is unknown beforehand?','mcq','[\"Linked lists are always more memory-efficient than arrays.\", \"Linked lists allow for dynamic sizing during runtime.\", \"Linked lists provide faster access to individual elements.\", \"Linked lists are easier to implement than arrays.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 15:12:29.148000','93ed3789293046b2ad02c443eb78d99c'),('698ebc38569d4196a95d1339df3e6c10','Which JavaScript engine is Node.js built upon?','mcq','[\"SpiderMonkey\", \"ChakraCore\", \"JavaScriptCore\", \"Chrome\'s V8\"]','3',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 13:17:37.693000','2942df64080146d4b8ed6664c0ad1698'),('6990fee424fd4bfcbda57650e9b2b5a9','What is the primary purpose of React Hooks as described in the introduction?','mcq','[\"To replace all class components with functional components.\", \"To allow functional components to \\\"hook into\\\" React features like state and side effects.\", \"To introduce a new syntax for defining components.\", \"To optimize rendering performance exclusively.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 13:12:16.930000','c07d62f459584f95ae7f68eeb706d841'),('69b23fe627f848939328ef6f85963dc5','Consider a right triangle with angle A. If the side adjacent to angle A is 8 units and the hypotenuse is 10 units, what is the length of the side opposite angle A?','mcq','[\"6 units\", \"7 units\", \"12 units\", \"18 units\"]','0',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 04:26:47.884000','cc870eabbfd240c89ac6408848cb520a'),('69bb2465d6854495bb84b9dd0cd88726','The Laplace Transform converts a function of time, f(t), into what?','mcq','[\"A function of a real frequency variable, ω.\", \"A function of a complex frequency variable, s.\", \"A constant value representing the integral of f(t).\", \"Another function of time, g(t), but in a simplified form.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.315000','583e36786da64bb99b44aa4d9069ac7a'),('6a7e09c7d0a341c88cba7548e74d78ab','In the context of Ordinary Differential Equations, what is the \"unknown\" we are typically looking for?','mcq','[\"A specific numerical value, like \'x\'.\", \"An entire function, like \'y(t)\'.\", \"A constant coefficient.\", \"A geometric shape.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 08:37:59.907000','cc3ca817ed7b4e68ab1e5a4f753082ce'),('6a9253846edb477bb55c3e5d337413a9','In a singly linked list, what does the `next` pointer of the last node point to?','mcq','[\"The first node (head)\", \"The second-to-last node\", \"null (or None in Python)\", \"Itself\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 15:12:29.156000','93ed3789293046b2ad02c443eb78d99c'),('6ab88836d6404adbb8fa447b560a7c8a','Which trigonometric function represents the ratio of the opposite side to the adjacent side in a right-angled triangle?','mcq','[\"Sine\", \"Cosine\", \"Tangent\", \"Secant\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-25 14:05:47.901000','54957642a32b4613a47f455c32225581'),('6ade840fc0634fc0ad39f8f4ba0c7e59','Why can arrays achieve O(1) (constant time) access to any element?','mcq','[\"Elements are sorted alphabetically.\", \"Each element stores a pointer to the next element.\", \"The memory address of any element can be directly calculated using its index.\", \"Arrays use a hashing function to locate elements.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 08:28:24.236000','2fb447789d6844ab931653728670e45f'),('6b26c338842f4cb299235c4b38cb8339','What is the main objective of a supervised learning algorithm?','mcq','[\"To generate new input data for training.\", \"To learn a mapping function from inputs to outputs.\", \"To categorize data without prior examples.\", \"To predict continuous values only.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 11:39:09.959000','213154490ba3486e90a776084201b209'),('6bd158848b0c4715815a5c8f803c7ad9','In the s-domain, what operation does differentiation in the time domain typically become?','mcq','[\"Division\", \"Integration\", \"Simple multiplication\", \"Subtraction\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.368000','8b3c58d12b724867ae015fc22480e682'),('6c0af5f52bf449f29dcc4fd1229d975c','In the context of the provided example, what does  \'k\' represent in the differential equation dy/dt = k * y?','mcq','[\"The initial value of y\", \"The independent variable\", \"A constant representing the growth or decay rate\", \"The time elapsed\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-25 13:49:16.004000','2e3142476d1b40b581611bc6202c1484'),('6c1684ea0bdd4fa8b1c760b8b9e27c59','What is the primary characteristic of a System of Ordinary Differential Equations (ODEs)?','mcq','[\"It describes how a single quantity changes with respect to multiple independent variables.\", \"It presents multiple interdependent ODEs that must be solved simultaneously.\", \"It involves partial derivatives to model interconnected dynamics.\", \"It only applies to linear equations with constant coefficients.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.312000','583e36786da64bb99b44aa4d9069ac7a'),('6c66b7afca374866a2a7e016c877d0a9','A ladder 15 feet long leans against a wall. The base of the ladder is 5 feet from the wall. What is the angle (to the nearest degree) the ladder makes with the ground?','mcq','[\"19 degrees\", \"71 degrees\", \"45 degrees\", \"30 degrees\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 04:26:47.896000','cc870eabbfd240c89ac6408848cb520a'),('6ca45d53798d4442b7511aa11b11f048','If you are focusing on an acute angle θ in a right triangle, which side is *not* considered the adjacent side?','mcq','[\"The side next to angle θ that is also the hypotenuse.\", \"The side directly across from angle θ.\", \"The side next to angle θ that is *not* the hypotenuse.\", \"The shortest side of the triangle.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 13:06:29.638000','688bcdacc17b4a498892e9e76f9327ae'),('6dad1e13104045c7b3730cec93fa3b60','What are First-Order Ordinary Differential Equations primarily used for according to the provided text?','mcq','[\"Solving for static numerical values in an equation.\", \"Describing how things change over time or space.\", \"Calculating the area under a curve.\", \"Finding the roots of polynomial equations.\"]','1',NULL,1,1