ld node with data \\\"D\\\" to the node with data \\\"B\\\".\", \"Adds a child node with data \\\"D\\\" to the node with data \\\"C\\\".\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 15:12:29.202000','b14f3b06fb69491690f18b541457cbd3'),('70840f683c79438aa0d29fbefeb10d14','From the perspective of a chosen non-90-degree angle in a right triangle, which description best fits the \"adjacent side\"?','mcq','[\"The side that is always the longest.\", \"The side that does not touch the chosen angle.\", \"The side touching the chosen angle, but not the hypotenuse.\", \"The side directly opposite the 90-degree angle.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-07 05:26:23.207000','7e79ee02067c4d7184d89acf0869ffd2'),('709b8c023525458fa002229a0a6ecf0f','The Fundamental Theorem of Calculus connects which two concepts?','mcq','[\"Limits and Derivatives\", \"Derivatives and Integrals\", \"Integrals and Trigonometry\", \"Limits and Algebra\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 15:34:06.712000','f80c63dc26994c49acd430438b3c8da5'),('70ff34eaa9b74c36bd153ad53177bec2','What is the sum of the angles in any triangle?','mcq','[\"90 degrees\", \"180 degrees\", \"270 degrees\", \"360 degrees\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 12:59:54.617000','d74592981391499e8b878c8c93a28fcd'),('7118516d254541a09290309470545698','How does the \"call stack\" manage function calls in programming languages?','mcq','[\"It uses a FIFO approach to process functions in the order they were declared.\", \"It pushes the execution context of a function onto the stack when called and pops it off when complete, following LIFO.\", \"It stores all function contexts in a random access memory block.\", \"It prioritizes functions based on their complexity, not their call order.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 20:50:03.131000','e826e68f1c6748f5b9c9d7288bb79587'),('7144afcb3e5244479ffb5594e63ac119','What is the primary purpose of a slope field?','mcq','[\"To calculate the exact solution to a differential equation.\", \"To visually represent the family of solutions to a differential equation.\", \"To determine the order of a differential equation.\", \"To separate variables in a first-order differential equation.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 12:45:57.170000','dba019f0d4bd4724b08c1b38d4ab94b3'),('7167df587f9f48429551d42f16781c76','What is the primary purpose of a \"base case\" in a recursive function?','mcq','[\"To define the initial parameters of the function.\", \"To handle errors that occur during execution.\", \"To provide a condition that stops the recursion.\", \"To optimize the function\'s performance.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 20:29:21.207000','2c012df388404db79dc0a79a2e4ee05c'),('724576baef084bdd91ada456650f5570','What does it mean for the ordinary differential equations (ODEs) within a system to be \"coupled\"?','mcq','[\"They are all solved using the same mathematical method.\", \"The derivative of one unknown function depends on other unknown functions in the system.\", \"They represent completely independent phenomena.\", \"They only involve a single unknown function.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 04:41:36.992000','68d8aaa820bf4a5f9690c34773449060'),('724a09ce09e049b0905c0f37bf19399e','What is the time complexity for accessing any element in an array, regardless of its position, as described in the text?','mcq','[\"O(N)\", \"O(log N)\", \"O(1)\", \"O(N^2)\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 08:28:24.234000','2fb447789d6844ab931653728670e45f'),('72a905f4591f4c0fa4b61dd5bc3316d0','A software engineer is building a system to predict the likelihood (as a percentage from 0-100%) that a customer will click on an advertisement. Is this primarily a Regression or Classification task?','mcq','[\"Regression, because it predicts a numerical value.\", \"Classification, because it predicts a probability which can be binned into categories.\", \"Regression, because the output is a continuous numerical value within a range.\", \"Classification, because the ultimate decision is whether they click or not.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:39:09.967000