tioned as a task typically requiring human intelligence that AI aims to perform?','mcq','[\"Learning\", \"Problem-solving\", \"Decision-making\", \"Manual dexterity\"]','3',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.805000','1e43574c488242829e18ca7d0f8b22d0'),('741cbe232d2f46a180696756c67ab628','According to the learning guide, what is the definition of one radian?','mcq','[\"The angle formed by two radii that are perpendicular to each other.\", \"The angle formed when a piece of string equal to the diameter is laid along the circumference.\", \"The angle formed by two radii connecting the center to the ends of a string exactly the length of the circle\'s radius laid along the circumference.\", \"The angle that measures 1/360th of a full circle.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 05:26:23.289000','34ffeb37f59442288df08c19a604ebf8'),('747cc4ef1a53409da81098d6d09aa4ad','According to the text, for an ODE to be considered \"linear,\" which of the following conditions must be met regarding the unknown function `y` and its derivatives?','mcq','[\"They must appear only to the first power and not be multiplied together.\", \"They must always have constant coefficients.\", \"They must be equal to zero.\", \"They must only depend on the independent variable.\"]','0',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 06:06:32.054000','181a2e4216dc40c4a57a9cfc7cc5dc60'),('74dbac9b6f0e4993a43dd0f8f912e1cd','If you change your reference angle from one non-right angle to the other in a right triangle, which side\'s label will *not* change?','mcq','[\"The opposite side\", \"The adjacent side\", \"The hypotenuse\", \"Both the opposite and adjacent sides\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 12:59:32.794000','f122771124df48edb04289b340bf1e22'),('7509f92087004c8a9b79b562455bc58b','In a right triangle, which side is always located directly opposite the 90-degree angle?','mcq','[\"The Adjacent Side\", \"The Opposite Side\", \"The Hypotenuse\", \"The Shortest Side\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 11:51:31.644000','1a3b7e637fb445fa9d533dc78e3a6ced')