formance impact.\", \"Its size is fixed and cannot be changed after creation.\", \"Its size can only be increased, not decreased.\", \"Its size is determined by the number of elements added at runtime.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 21:42:25.674000','3261c532d2f2404a93b1bcbe57a081c7'),('7621e9bac53f4ac7ad92377a670bb8af','In traditional degree measure, how many degrees are in a full circle?','mcq','[\"90 degrees\", \"180 degrees\", \"270 degrees\", \"360 degrees\"]','3',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 05:26:23.294000','34ffeb37f59442288df08c19a604ebf8'),('76291f7c29c34d59a9983c8765e1748c','What is the primary characteristic of a differential equation?','mcq','[\"It always involves an integral.\", \"It describes a static system.\", \"It involves a derivative of an unknown function.\", \"It only applies to physics problems.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:12:08.142000','90d62550c0d54237947475f5e801a6f6'),('769989f711c141938f4b63e514ccb14b','A pharmaceutical company conducts a clinical trial to test the effectiveness of a new drug. They compare the recovery rates of patients who received the new drug to the recovery rates of patients who received a placebo. What type of inferential statistical method would be most appropriate for analyzing the results of this trial?','mcq','[\"Estimation of the average recovery time for all patients.\", \"Hypothesis testing to determine if the new drug is significantly more effective than the placebo.\", \"Calculating the standard deviation of the recovery times in both groups.\", \"Creating a histogram of the recovery times for each group.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 16:35:28.534000','eb2488304b174a7abb73e58e9bcc692b'),('769c6c959c444f4cbd6f1363217d6427','Which of the following equations is an example of a quadratic equation?','mcq','[\"$2x + 3 = 7$\", \"$x + 5 = 10$\", \"$x^2 + 2x - 3 = 0$\", \"$y = 5x - 2$\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 06:25:58.995000','b9a164d3c5b7434e96636a3d473e2a4b'),('76a48636952e450ab0b3e59da08d649d','What is the primary characteristic of the dataset used in supervised learning?','mcq','[\"It consists only of input features without any corresponding outputs.\", \"It is \\\"labeled\\\" with the correct answers for each input.\", \"It contains data that has not been preprocessed or cleaned.\", \"It is generated in real-time by the learning algorithm.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.897000','b99b3658c8984ce3953c7fd44551e55a'),('76ee96da1eaf4963ac78e436c63f6ee1','Which of the following is an example of social engineering?','mcq','[\"Installing antivirus software.\", \"Manipulating someone into revealing their password by pretending to be IT support.\", \"Using a strong password.\", \"Regularly updating software.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 13:19:18.131000','a47931f317a04af0a9f546c8832276bb'),('76fc95baaef648ef8e067997af4b8866','What is the process called where React compares the Virtual DOM with the real DOM and updates only the changed parts?','mcq','[\"Rendering\", \"Reconciliation\", \"Virtualization\", \"Synchronization\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 14:13:35.419000','96a8219f1d584d34916d6be052dd1ff8'),('7719f2ceed1c4bc7a82ac795ddec2d98','Which of the following is NOT a direct business benefit of robust network security?','mcq','[\"Data Protection\", \"Enhanced System Stability\", \"Business Continuity\", \"Reputation Management\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 13:32:44.331000','9c90fb71367d4613a6572ff46ac8264b'),('77320348443449a698516a14fa27a6b3','How are elements stored in an array, based on the provided introduction?','mcq','[\"In scattered, non-sequential memory locations.\", \"At contiguous memory locations.\", \"In a linked list format.\", \"Only in the computer\'s cache memory.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 21:02:18.983000','7f1db26bcb06449eb7da26f97f6ea148'),('7820ccb59ac942a9a6c71b1b17a6ee8f','If a variable `my_string` holds the value \"Hello\", what would be the result of an operation to find its length (e.g., `len(my_string)` in Python or `my_string.length()` in Java)?','m