oes through the water cycle?','mcq','[\"It constantly increases.\", \"It constantly decreases.\", \"It stays approximately the same.\", \"It varies greatly depending on the season.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 21:04:32.202000','06d70946008649f4bfdef293bc3ebe03'),('7cdcaa1c6876454987178589ece97d09','What will the above code snippet print?','mcq','[\"Location A\", \"(10, 20)\", \"KeyError\", \"None\"]','0',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-23 10:13:33.502000','184fa81649604f3bab4551c17acc7cf6'),('7db7ba4b0e6c46b7833d1074241c665f','If $y = f(t)$ describes the position of a car at time $t$, what does $d^2y/dt^2$ (or `y\'\'`) represent?','mcq','[\"The car\'s instantaneous position.\", \"The car\'s instantaneous velocity.\", \"The car\'s acceleration.\", \"The total distance traveled.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 08:37:59.908000','cc3ca817ed7b4e68ab1e5a4f753082ce'),('7e2af8408c754e789c32cc2cd15be6c5','When solving a first-order Ordinary Differential Equation of the form `dy/dx = f(x, y)`, what is the ultimate goal?','mcq','[\"To find the value of the independent variable x.\", \"To determine the function `f(x, y)`.\", \"To find the function `y(x)` that satisfies the equation.\", \"To calculate the derivative `dy/dx` at a specific point.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.182000','39e47832557e4d669ee13501cc74066a'),('7e6bf7b7ae504f4291c8e8d3abb4878b','What does the \"TOA\" in \"SOH CAH TOA\" represent?','mcq','[\"tangent = opposite / adjacent\", \"tangent = adjacent / opposite\", \"tangent = opposite / hypotenuse\", \"tangent = hypotenuse / opposite\"]','0',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 16:29:52.966000','bae46a26221c4967826fca4d0322be46'),('7e8faae4c25c4cef837bb49386ac97d1','What does the \"Differential\" part of \"Second-Order Linear Differential Equation\" signify?','mcq','[\"The equation involves differences between variables.\", \"The equation contains derivatives, which describe rates of change.\", \"The equation is used to find the difference between two functions.\", \"The equation is solved using differential calculus only.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:49:32.226000','5fad0c9e38ef4d738b63eeec385fe100'),('7f025c58c8ea44f782400e2adad195df','According to the text, what is a key difference between Machine Learning and traditional programming?','mcq','[\"Traditional programming uses algorithms, while ML does not.\", \"ML requires every logic path to be explicitly coded by a human.\", \"ML builds algorithms that learn from data, unlike traditional programming which explicitly codes logic.\", \"Traditional programming is a subfield of Artificial Intelligence, while ML is not.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 04:33:42.413000','5b081e0876bd4e20b08ef44773d522c4'),('7f56ea0e9da5408f90304707d3d762cb','What is the purpose of the \"Testing and Debugging\" stage in the problem-solving process?','mcq','[\"To ensure the code compiles without errors.\", \"To identify and fix any defects or errors in the code.\", \"To optimize the code for better performance.\", \"To document the code.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-23 10:03:17.317000','37324f3f87844a7a85ebaca3d59ad85c'),('7f7f64bdb69d424589d22e936c4952ff','What is the order of the differential equation $d^2y/dx^2 + 3(dy/dx) + 2y = 0$?','mcq','[\"First-order\", \"Second-order\", \"Third-order\", \"Zeroth-order\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 17:42:08.620000','07ab4b72c08c4ba4b53ba1522c72adeb'),('7f81819b01a6453480fa0e808755cffe','When focusing on an acute angle in a right triangle, which sides\' labels (Opposite or Adjacent) can change depending on which acute angle is being considered?','mcq','[\"Only the Hypotenuse\", \"Only the Opposite Side\", \"Only the Adjacent Side\", \"Both the Opposite and Adjacent Sides\"]','3',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 12:07:50.560000','670b202c2b2c48afb3656a5d17357b9f'),('800c4f828fa24d44a39593543018b6b1','In a right-angled triangle, which side is always opposite the right angle?','mcq','[\"Adjacent\", \"Opposite\", \"Hypotenuse\", \"None of the above\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 17:35:46.462000','b298