es a derivative represent?','mcq','[\"The average rate of change of a function.\", \"The instantaneous rate of change of a function.\", \"The total change of a function over a given interval.\", \"The area under the curve of a function.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 16:38:53.367000','e967a031eb1d4bc7a7b9e1540362e963'),('84f9685d440e4a44902b8dd770119fb7','Why is our solar system specifically called the \"solar\" system?','mcq','[\"Because it is exceptionally bright.\", \"Because it contains many different types of stars.\", \"Because its central star is the Sun, also known as Sol.\", \"Because it is a system of spherical objects.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 06:34:38.385000','bdb724c12e6f4e8eba35f6ab62281883'),('85202117979e4546a73c98f783f82f70','What is the defining characteristic of a *second-order* linear differential equation?','mcq','[\"It involves the first derivative of a function.\", \"It involves the second derivative of a function.\", \"The function and its derivatives are raised to powers.\", \"The equation contains only constant coefficients.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 17:24:08.325000','8cfc3c86b4e74d76961da48ee126de45'),('866a4da4b19d4279b2a90a9dc2298d85','What is the main characteristic that distinguishes a Django App from a Django Project, according to the provided content?','mcq','[\"A Django Project is reusable, while a Django App is not.\", \"A Django App is a self-contained module for a specific feature, whereas a Django Project is the entire web application.\", \"A Django Project handles data structure, while a Django App handles URL routing.\", \"A Django App contains `settings.py`, while a Django Project contains `urls.py`.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 16:49:32.801000','ab9fc04dfb08474b81448a4cd33f8167'),('86d9574952a34a8e9f1ac42fd661af89','Which of the following best describes Feature Engineering?','mcq','[\"Cleaning missing values and inconsistencies in data.\", \"The process of creating new input features from existing raw data.\", \"Running a machine learning algorithm on raw data.\", \"Evaluating the performance of a trained model.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.984000','3921f356c51641d498226e1711b0788c'),('86f6892ffacd43038dd048a2782fc9ac','Which of the following data types CANNOT be used as a key in a Python dictionary?','mcq','[\"String\", \"Integer\", \"Tuple\", \"List\"]','3',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 08:07:04.352000','a5e342692eee4cfda23903ede3e64633'),('8727ceda475a48c890d06eae669ae5a5','Which of the following is a first-order differential equation?','mcq','[\"y\'\' + y = 0\", \"dy/dx = x² + y\", \"d²y/dx² + x(dy/dx) = x²\", \"y\'\'\' - 2y\'\' + y\' = e^x\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 15:26:36.442000','4137eacfac1e4664b195d2131d9d20f3'),('8762391644f245e080d5501a0c1e0904','According to the text, what is the core challenge in unsupervised learning that makes model evaluation difficult?','mcq','[\"The algorithms are too complex to understand.\", \"There are no ground truth labels to compare against.\", \"The data is always too large to process efficiently.\", \"Unsupervised models are prone to overfitting.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 10:48:52.080000','35d3b7ac1bb4457f9756b22f76c4f8bc'),('87bb211394704cc69c1910180b2a1791','Which of the following is NOT a direct influence of financial markets?','mcq','[\"Interest rates on loans\", \"Currency exchange rates\", \"The price of groceries at your local supermarket\", \"Investment opportunities in stocks and bonds\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 12:49:20.583000','34a3b54141064b28bed319d51e22ff57'),('88c1031b0f1a4d248de8bac57949bc35','What is the defining characteristic of a right triangle?','mcq','[\"It has three equal sides.\", \"It contains one angle that measures exactly 90 degrees.\", \"All its angles are acute.\", \"Its longest side is always opposite an acute angle.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 11:47:29.006000','64a5ab1b9a8e4be3b8592d4fcbf8f20d'),('88db166e3301457792740c71101cd0fe','According to the content, what is a key benefit of a trading plan 