ion of bacteria.\", \"The rate of change of the bacteria population over time.\", \"The growth constant.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 17:12:08.401000','0c9341197cf04a2ca651caba9cadd47d'),('89c8fdf0d79d4758a05a3579caad31dd','According to the text, why do arrays often lead to better cache performance?','mcq','[\"Because they can store elements of different data types, allowing for diverse data processing.\", \"Due to their memory locality, where elements are stored close together in memory.\", \"As they are always sorted, which simplifies data retrieval.\", \"Because they are primarily used for network communication, which benefits from caching.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 20:44:51.816000','560d5101bf2c44239f01516875752912'),('89f6ce3982c549e1a1d088d46e368f8a','If $dy/dx = 2xy$, and y(0) = 1, what is y(1)?','mcq','[\"$e$\", \"$e^2$\", \"$2e$\", \"$1/e$\"]','0',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 12:45:57.175000','dba019f0d4bd4724b08c1b38d4ab94b3'),('8a5c6695f8314b9596a74a2de20f1d0f','The \"particle path\" analogy for visualizing the solution of a first-order linear differential equation uses what physical quantity to represent dy/dx?','mcq','[\"Acceleration\", \"Position\", \"Velocity\", \"Force\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 17:30:19.610000','f06fd1b459b449a99a0c41709c6f67e7'),('8adccc3ba2a24a8e8ff920de5bcd1740','What is the general solution to the differential equation $y\'\' + 4y\' + 4y = 0$?','mcq','[\"$y = C1e^-2x + C2e^-2x$\", \"$y = (C1 + C2x)e^-2x$\", \"$y = C1e^2x + C2xe^2x$\", \"$y = C1cos(2x) + C2sin(2x)$\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 13:34:31.238000','c2bc3a63f44e4f3cac4c98155de6e633'),('8baefe9eb55046a68419d359066a5046','Why is the constant of integration ($C$) important when evaluating indefinite integrals?','mcq','[\"It determines the specific antiderivative within the family of antiderivatives.\", \"It represents the area under the curve of the original function.\", \"It is necessary to make the integral definite.\", \"It simplifies the calculation of the derivative.\"