hat defines a differential equation?','mcq','[\"It is an equation that relates a function with its derivatives.\", \"It is an equation that always involves two independent variables.\", \"It is an equation used exclusively for financial models.\", \"It is an equation that only describes static systems.\"]','0',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 12:21:30.301000','1c18e83623634608a445f8410a760a8c'),('a20cd6729659483fbf4aa09c714b752f','The general solution `y(x)` to a second-order non-homogeneous ODE is a combination of which two distinct parts?','mcq','[\"The particular solution and the general solution\", \"The homogeneous solution and the particular solution\", \"The complementary function and the trivial solution\", \"The forced response and the initial conditions\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.311000','bf188003cab7489f994226630f178712'),('a248da8b194c4cb083d281d6258bf395','The differential equation dy/dt = ky describes what type of growth or decay?','mcq','[\"Linear\", \"Quadratic\", \"Exponential\", \"Logarithmic\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 16:43:13.364000','1705d496895a4360a920019413ccd5ea'),('a262223287ab498f8021e62b55072c8a','Which side of a right triangle is defined as being next to the angle of reference but *not* the hypotenuse?','mcq','[\"The Opposite Side\", \"The Longest Side\", \"The Adjacent Side\", \"The 90-degree angle side\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-08 11:47:29.020000','64a5ab1b9a8e4be3b8592d4fcbf8f20d'),('a2e672bade5e402da3f192430aee62fb','In the context of Systems of First-Order Linear Differential Equations, what does \"First-Order\" signify?','mcq','[\"The equations are the most important ones in the system.\", \"The highest derivative present in the equation is the first derivative.\", \"The dependent variable appears only to the first power.\", \"The system involves only one dependent variable.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:49:32.365000','fba23063a68e489597f13e5b2c5a974d'),('a2edc4a1be5d4a41a4e764b10da0c97d','What are \"props\" in React?','mcq','[\