lve problems autonomously.\", \"To create machines that can only perform repetitive, data-intensive tasks.\", \"To develop robots that look and act exactly like humans.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 21:10:58.592000','b1552691ac364cc88e4de71e1814eae0'),('a7d9a9250406474d8d7a5821462c6f5d','What is a key characteristic that differentiates Machine Learning (ML) from traditional explicit programming approaches?','mcq','[\"ML focuses on creating rigid \\\"if-then\\\" rules for every scenario.\", \"ML requires developers to explicitly program every possible scenario.\", \"ML enables systems to learn from data without being explicitly programmed for every scenario.\", \"ML aims to replace human intelligence entirely without any learning.\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.803000','1e43574c488242829e18ca7d0f8b22d0'),('a8d085c060ff4356b066bd926f5be8f2','If \'y\' represents position in a Second-Order Linear Differential Equation, what physical quantity does d^2y/dt^2 represent?','mcq','[\"Velocity\", \"Displacement\", \"Acceleration\", \"Jerk\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:49:32.230000','5fad0c9e38ef4d738b63eeec385fe100'),('a8e5a051bfe645148ddb6ef6ffe290e7','What is a slope field?','mcq','[\"A field of flowers growing on a slope.\", \"A graphical representation of the slopes of the solution curves at different points.\", \"The integral of a differential equation.\", \"The derivative of a differential equation.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 08:21:47.241000','f58716d1fde34d33b2303a0b2260771e'),('a972516d311d479f990d9e7f29b3efe0','What is the primary role of JavaScript in web development, as described in the introduction?','mcq','[\"To provide the structure of a web page.\", \"To handle the styling and visual presentation of a web page.\", \"To bring interactivity and dynamic behavior to web pages.\", \"To store data on a remote server.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 13:25:59.712000','b5632b45519049c494b634084e77c2a8'),('a998b91315bb4215860bf684c7f7066b','What does \"Time Complexity\" refer to in the context of algorithms?','mcq','[\"The total time taken to write the code for an algorithm.\", \"How the runtime of an algorithm scales with the input size.\", \"The complexity of the code syntax.\", \"The time it takes to compile the code.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-23 10:03:17.317000','37324f3f87844a7a85ebaca3d59ad85c'),('aaa776346a774af399d9e673105fa828','What mathematical technique is used to solve the differential equation dy/dt = k * y in the provided example?','mcq','[\"Substitution\", \"Integration by parts\", \"Separation of variables\", \"Partial fraction decomposition\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-25 13:49:16.008000','2e3142476d1b40b581611bc6202c1484'),('aaaf4cd8b86f4d1793b9cb0f1a04f99f','What is the form of the integrating factor μ(x) for the differential equation $dy/dx + P(x)y = Q(x)$?','mcq','[\"∫P(x)dx\", \"e^(∫P(x)dx)\", \"e^(-∫P(x)dx)\", \"P(x) * Q(x)\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 17:30:19.606000','f06fd1b459b449a99a0c41709c6f67e7'),('aafe8e51da874eae8513e865fa91f31a','What happens if a recursive function doesn\'t have a base case?','mcq','[\"The program runs normally.\", \"The function returns 0.\", \"A stack overflow error occurs.\", \"The compiler generates a warning.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 15:28:24.294000','51b49eec339f486a8bbecd4cb6f16e74'),('ab5c1e11c20b4f37a967d5eb827322ff','In computer science, what type of data structure is a Stack?','mcq','[\"A non-linear data structure\", \"A hierarchical data structure\", \"A linear data structure\", \"A relational data structure\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 20:50:03.124000','e826e68f1c6748f5b9c9d7288bb79587'),('aba0b9417e364718a1f103d44ef292d6','What real-world phenomenon is accurately modeled by the differential equation dy/dt = k * y where k is negative?','mcq','[\"Population growth\", \"Compound interest\", \"Radioactive decay\", \"Velocity of a falling object\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 13:49:16.006000','2e3142476d1b40b581611bc6202c1484'),('ac16e9b286e64b45b9c64934868a7e10','I