e definition provided?','mcq','[\"y\'\' + 2y\' + y = 0\", \"3y\'\' - 5y\' + 7y = sin(t)\", \"y\'\' + (y\')^2 = 0\", \"d^2y/dt^2 + t * dy/dt + y = 0\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.284000','25fe5f4dec7743a3aabad137fbc9b4f4'),('c123400a5fcf430b8094540cacfb0032','What characteristic defines an ODE as \"Second-Order\"?','mcq','[\"It involves two independent variables.\", \"The unknown function appears to the second power.\", \"The highest derivative present in the equation is the second derivative.\", \"It has exactly two terms on the left-hand side.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.282000','0a43196b3ca94ea9b55f955d79081eb5'),('c1d9f82b6a384318a4ef7b85382dc9c2','Which order type guarantees execution but not a specific price?','mcq','[\"Limit Order\", \"Market Order\", \"Stop-Loss Order\", \"Stop-Limit Order\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 12:49:20.706000','64ef23a989fb4375a15a84f4bdd8372f'),('c1ec0ec02699430bbad63e2348faebc7','According to the text, what does Data Preparation primarily involve?','mcq','[\"Developing new machine learning algorithms.\", \"Deploying the final machine learning model.\", \"Cleaning, transforming, and organizing raw data for ML algorithms.\", \"Writing documentation for the machine learning project.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 11:39:09.862000','c442c409bf204cde89647871fea276a8'),('c202cdb5d8c94d5cad7c54ad7e12eb8b','Which of the following is a real-world application of vector spaces?','mcq','[\"Representing images as vectors in a high-dimensional space for image processing.\", \"Modeling the state of a quantum system using a complex vector space.\", \"Analyzing network traffic flow using vectors to represent data packets.\", \"All of the above.\"]','3',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 13:04:13.101000','d0c51f8abe2d430ea608e3febc1f251e'),('c228ad1a46e440dfa6c16f20659f5f73','In the example $dy/dx = x * y$, what is the general solution for $y$?','mcq','[\"$y = x^2 + C$\", \"$y = Ce^x$\", \"$y = Ae^{(1/2)x^2}$\", \"$y = ln|x| + C$\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2