 of the first element in an array?','mcq','[\"1\", \"0\", \"-1\", \"The array\'s length minus one\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 21:45:40.243000','42447b7afa794ff6a1424bf01b8f1404'),('c67b9d92191640cd80459fa62bb93ac3','What fundamental principle governs the addition and removal of elements in a Stack?','mcq','[\"FIFO (First In, First Out)\", \"LIFO (Last In, First Out)\", \"FILO (First In, Last Out)\", \"LILO (Last In, Last Out)\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 20:50:03.121000','e826e68f1c6748f5b9c9d7288bb79587'),('c6ae974ebe104718af12ecc6b9d4a11b','Cyberstalking primarily leverages which of the following to harass or intimidate an individual?','mcq','[\"Only physical presence.\", \"Only face-to-face confrontations.\", \"The internet and other electronic means.\", \"Direct verbal threats in person.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 08:41:35.766000','24147261eb054830a3c934ff3e8ac7ac'),('c6cf610c9e2d4da09eaca78291ebb7fc','Which keyword is used to create a new instance of a class in Java?','mcq','[\"class\", \"new\", \"instance\", \"object\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-22 12:31:23.212000','1dab1251f28041e093dfebd6d1a2e112'),('c72dec674e234b97affbf2386fc23ef6','Which of the following best describes a JFET?','mcq','[\"A current-controlled device that uses two types of charge carriers.\", \"A voltage-controlled device that uses only one type of charge carrier.\", \"A current-controlled device with extremely low input impedance.\", \"A voltage-controlled device primarily used as a current source, depending on two charge carriers.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 05:22:58.998000','2aa1d720ac864a3bb798f0c0054bbd65'),('c7dfdc1e9a32410189887f2c4981709f','In a right-angled triangle, which side is always the longest?','mcq','[\"Adjacent\", \"Opposite\", \"Hypotenuse\", \"It depends on the angle\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 17:13:00.885000','1a4dbeeb018746cf974c6d060517a63e'),('c7e67c86f48e4645893b66d1cfe0fa70','What is the integrating factor used to solve the differential equation $dy/dx + 3y = e^x$?','mcq','[\"$e^x$\", \"$e^{3x}$\", \"$3e^x$\", \"$e^{-3x}$\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-25 13:40:19.957000','40a489946c0b4bf7802b8f631060302c'),('c86bad9a7c5040d383d7983b70578998','1. A program is written to calculate the square root of any positive number using a predefined mathematical formula.','mcq','[\"Both scenarios represent Machine Learning because they involve computer systems.\", \"Scenario 1 is an example of Machine Learning, while Scenario 2 is traditional programming.\", \"Scenario 2 is an example of Machine Learning because it learns patterns from data without explicit rules for each image, unlike Scenario 1 which uses an explicitly programmed formula.\", \"Neither scenario represents Machine Learning as they both require some form of programming.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 04:33:42.426000','5b081e0876bd4e20b08ef44773d522c4'),('c88465c1c1fc4c18ae856f329ba03f15','What is the element a₃₂ in a matrix A?','mcq','[\"The element in the 2nd row and 3rd column.\", \"The element in the 3rd row and 2nd column.\", \"The sum of the elements in the 3rd row and 2nd column.\", \"The product of 3 and 2.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 13:04:13.018000','a80a0f796e1246bebf3136fad8d10274'),('c8c18791b9e54cf285d6f549aebf1374','Which security measure involves configuring servers and applications to minimize attack surfaces?','mcq','[\"Vulnerability Scanning\", \"Security Hardening\", \"Incident Response\", \"Secure Development Practices\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 13:32:44.464000','187d9618da144e5bbabac4a3c83dde0d'),('ca5ffb15ad544d6d8d02ab2af791c944','In a Partial Differential Equation (PDE), what does the \"dependent variable\" typically represent?','mcq','[\"The spatial coordinates (x, y, z).\", \"The time variable (t).\", \"The unknown function we are solving for, representing a physical quantity.\", \"The order of the highest derivative.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.385000','d827e24d6d5c426f8c2d0441ba7f6229'),('ca796f76e6ea4b418fd8463db346a4c6','Which cluster