ing algorithms?','mcq','[\"To find a specific element within a dataset.\", \"To arrange data in a particular order.\", \"To optimize database queries.\", \"To reduce the size of a dataset.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 15:12:29.240000','8d084366378c421d866add59f6217fef'),('cd6142984a474a0eadf251b16ab7db6e','What is the primary purpose of an array in computer science?','mcq','[\"To store a single value of any data type.\", \"To organize and access a collection of elements of the same data type.\", \"To perform complex mathematical calculations.\", \"To create graphical user interfaces.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-22 15:37:06.666000','dd5923b5fc0f4f349c305bbe0bb7ffc4'),('cdab51f05bf749b5b7da4e4feb4d1ac9','A differential equation is fundamentally an equation that relates a function with what?','mcq','[\"Its constants.\", \"Its variables.\", \"Its derivatives.\", \"Its limits.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.203000','826bbc0263b34345b167ee6f0d969cab'),('cdb4e554698246a7a0be6ad0ac954a9a','Which type of data is essential for training a supervised learning model?','mcq','[\"Unlabeled data\", \"Partially labeled data\", \"Labeled data\", \"Raw, unstructured data\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 11:08:58.895000','f1f9d979a3d34273af69fef0281854c9'),('ce08d49b668f48cc9882f9eec649a483','In a slope field for the differential equation dy/dx = y, what would the slope be at the point (2, 3)?','mcq','[\"2\", \"3\", \"5\", \"6\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 13:06:14.234000','eff0705446ba4e4cb991a2430a13dd0c'),('cf0af8761d7a416f9524a808c55589d4','In a Second-Order Linear Homogeneous ODE, what does the term \"Homogeneous\" signify?','mcq','[\"All coefficients are constant.\", \"The equation has only one solution.\", \"The right-hand side of the equation is zero.\", \"The equation involves only even derivatives.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-10 04:22:14.283000','0a43196b3ca94ea9b55f955d79081eb5'),('cf98f58adfe54e26b3322668d8bf27a6','How does Machine Learning (ML) relate to Artificial Intelligence (AI) according to the provided content?','mcq','[\"ML is a broader field that encompasses AI.\", \"AI is a subset of ML.\", \"ML is a fundamental subset of AI.\", \"AI and ML are completely separate and unrelated fields.\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 10:48:51.801000','1e43574c488242829e18ca7d0f8b22d0'),('d02ef3cd0f48436cadef8df723346e0c','In many programming languages (e.g., Python, Java, C#), strings are considered immutable. What does \"immutable\" mean in this context?','mcq','[\"The string\'s value can be changed directly after creation.\", \"The string\'s value cannot be changed after creation; any modification creates a new string.\", \"The string can only store numeric characters.\", \"The string is stored in a fixed memory location that cannot be accessed.\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-08 03:59:29.943000','c454e6e34f914a0abbc824a90665c214'),('d038bc8434e849569f8c73ef8ee2500a','The logistic growth model (dN/dt = rN(1 - N/K)) accounts for which factor that simpler growth models often ignore?','mcq','[\"Initial population size\", \"Time dependence\", \"Carrying capacity\", \"Growth rate\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-23 06:07:32.243000','6cead2cbee80450b9040a1d4901a86df'),('d0c1f899719c4673bdd87070e3995b4a','What is the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle?','mcq','[\"The shortest side\", \"The side opposite the 90-degree angle\", \"One of the two shorter sides\", \"The side adjacent to the 90-degree angle\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 17:50:02.044000','1204664ce0cf410fa019d5ce76bdd3fe'),('d0e2082ef3d8404cb757c5d8067701a7','In the term \"Second-Order Linear Differential Equation,\" what does \"Second-Order\" specifically indicate?','mcq','[\"The equation has two dependent variables.\", \"The highest power of the dependent variable is two.\", \"The highest derivative present in the equation is the second derivative.\", \"The equation involves two different types of derivatives.\"]','2',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:49:32.225000','5fad0c9e38ef4d738b63eeec385fe100'),('d0e20a8