irect methods cumbersome.\", \"The necessity to always use the Laplace Transform, which is complex itself.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.317000','583e36786da64bb99b44aa4d9069ac7a'),('f4ec31cf59ca40f5a699fa4c28570ef7','What is the output of the following code snippet?','mcq','[\"\\\"gram\\\"\", \"\\\"ogramm\\\"\", \"\\\"Prog\\\"\", \"\\\"rogram\\\"\"]','0',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 13:35:25.081000','a3f6eb5159cc4b348a509d574032e3bc'),('f50389c00f46421dbf6df845b105c21b','What is the primary purpose of a hash function in a Python dictionary?','mcq','[\"To sort the keys alphabetically.\", \"To map keys to indices in the underlying array.\", \"To store the values associated with the keys.\", \"To determine the size of the dictionary.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 08:07:04.349000','a5e342692eee4cfda23903ede3e64633'),('f5205bf9e87149c8a298a878eda3f653','The ability of MOSFETs to switch between on and off states very rapidly makes them particularly suitable for which type of application?','mcq','[\"Long-term data storage in non-volatile memory.\", \"High-frequency applications such as digital logic and RF circuits.\", \"Generating stable, low-frequency audio signals.\", \"Providing constant current sources for analog sensors.\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 05:22:59.112000','df74bd8654d7494c9540dfbc4a48887a'),('f55d11c9005b43e0961220771877d5cd','A puddle on a sidewalk disappears on a sunny day. This is an example of which stage of the water cycle?','mcq','[\"Condensation\", \"Precipitation\", \"Evaporation\", \"Runoff\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-07 21:04:32.207000','06d70946008649f4bfdef293bc3ebe03'),('f56e50e5b9c242559be19c2a51df43b9','Which of the following is an example of a `boolean` data type in JavaScript?','mcq','[\"`\\\"Hello\\\"`\", \"`100`\", \"`true`\", \"`{ key: \\\"value\\\" }`\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-08 13:25:59.715000','b5632b45519049c494b634084e77c2a8'),('f58bed2214324a928d76684aeccddd7b','What is a primary reason for using advanced techniques like series solutions and Laplace transforms, according to the learning guide?','mcq','[\"To solve constant-coefficient linear ODEs more efficiently.\", \"To find solutions for ODEs with non-constant coefficients or sudden impulse forcing functions.\", \"To simplify algebraic equations into differential equations.\", \"To only model systems in quantum mechanics.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 04:41:36.916000','ea2a1146356a492a93bd4a7e382ea9a5'),('f5923f20ab2145d4ad84ba1790babde6','The Laplace Transform acts as a mathematical translator, converting a function f(t) from which domain to which other domain?','mcq','[\"Frequency domain to Time domain\", \"s-domain to Time domain\", \"Time domain to s-domain\", \"Algebra domain to Calculus domain\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.366000','8b3c58d12b724867ae015fc22480e682'),('f5ba83b4675c4b6e9019b174be75ae93','What is the primary purpose of a differential equation?','mcq','[\"To calculate the area under a curve.\", \"To describe the relationship between a function and its derivatives.\", \"To find the maximum and minimum values of a function.\", \"To determine the convergence or divergence of a series.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 13:49:15.995000','2e3142476d1b40b581611bc6202c1484'),('f5c577cfe39341eaaf969a3e3f659e4b','In Python, which built-in function is used to determine the number of characters (length) in a string?','mcq','[\"`size()`\", \"`length()`\", \"`count()`\", \"`len()`\"]','3',NULL,1,3,'2025-10-07 21:37:20.307000','043c6b11563b4934a5d5bb8d5e2541be'),('f5e576226472454e9fa61e1645a440ab','Which of the following is an example of a second-order linear homogeneous differential equation?','mcq','[\"y\'\' + 2xy\' + y = sin(x)\", \"y\'\' - 4y\' + 5y = 0\", \"y\' + xy = x²\", \"y\'\' + y\'\'\' + y = 1\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 17:45:26.454000','d6ad787af2134dd9a68c5151dbc2fb0e'),('f70aeacceb204b5ab101355f4e33abed','What is the primary purpose of a first-order differential equation?','mcq','[\"To relate a function to its second d