 \"The equation involves only even-numbered derivatives.\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-10 04:29:19.247000','17597f1a791f409a944747c9b8e4a52b'),('fb419e8942cc4c8babaaeddda94b9858','What is the primary advantage of using Dynamic Programming?','mcq','[\"Increased code readability.\", \"Reduced time complexity by avoiding redundant computations.\", \"Simplified problem formulation.\", \"Enhanced memory utilization.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 13:38:42.718000','b9b62e86eebd4d709ca9e5ba7e4d6497'),('fb448bb887fb4d45b2736ce263e8b0c5','According to the text, what is a key characteristic of Machine Learning (ML) systems?','mcq','[\"They require explicit programming for every possible scenario.\", \"They are primarily focused on creating rigid rules for decision-making.\", \"They learn from data without being explicitly programmed for every scenario.\", \"They are a field entirely separate from Artificial Intelligence.\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-08 11:32:24.705000','dae1f871cc4d427b993184c73a30dc76'),('fb55ad70870e454a914732e041b0c34b','What is the primary purpose of Systems of Linear Differential Equations as described in the text?','mcq','[\"To describe how a single quantity changes over time independently.\", \"To model how multiple quantities evolve over time when they are interconnected.\", \"To solve algebraic equations with multiple variables.\", \"To analyze static relationships between different quantities.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.496000','6e1f70b8f00c435c9146185cf9273095'),('fb5905ce70de43cca175f05b4776c19c','What is the purpose of a loss function in training a neural network?','mcq','[\"To introduce non-linearity into the network\", \"To measure the difference between the network\'s predictions and the actual values\", \"To adjust the weights of the connections between neurons\", \"To receive the initial input data\"]','1',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 15:06:39.377000','0c2ac4e5145a4246b60adf0eec649060'),('fb5dff41bf924b06835c196fc114f843','According to the learning guide, what is a differential equation?','mcq','[\"An equation that solves for a specific number.\", \"An equation that relates a function to its derivatives.\", \"An equation that only involves algebraic expressions.\", \"An equation used exclusively in geometry.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-07 06:06:31.963000','bc9b67b14734495d92587aaa9e3f597e'),('fbf37a673c644aeda15ab9cf4dc03b1b','What data type would you use to store a collection of unique, unordered items in Python?','mcq','[\"List\", \"Tuple\", \"Set\", \"Dictionary\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-18 15:47:10.053000','5a37bdf1b08e450a873e7a3f08f960ec'),('fbf3a8ae57284778a8107058e8c66e97','What does a derivative represent in the context of a function?','mcq','[\"The average rate of change of the function.\", \"The instantaneous rate of change of the function.\", \"The area under the curve of the function.\", \"The inverse of the function.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-09-25 08:21:47.224000','f58716d1fde34d33b2303a0b2260771e'),('fc180cbc764f4dc6bf7a2bf05def66ef','Why is the \"Systems\" aspect crucial in Systems of Linear Differential Equations?','mcq','[\"It means we only have one differential equation to solve.\", \"It indicates that all quantities change independently of each other.\", \"It signifies multiple interconnected differential equations, each describing a different quantity.\", \"It implies that only algebraic equations are involved.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.510000','6e1f70b8f00c435c9146185cf9273095'),('fc2ab230b43f4f2c988e98d4d18f6802','What is the difference between the JDK and the JRE?','mcq','[\"The JDK is used for running Java applications, while the JRE is used for developing them.\", \"The JDK includes the JRE and additional tools for development, while the JRE is only for running Java applications.\", \"The JDK and JRE are the same thing.\", \"The JDK is for Windows, while the JRE is for macOS.\"]','1',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 12:31:23.093000','961e66a1e4ff4e7a991efd2928be8e0e'),('fc486059171a4d1d947ca570c775e8d7','In most programming languages, what is a \"string\"?','mcq','[\"A sequence of characters.\", \"A numerical data type.\", \"A boolean value.\", \"A single character.\"]','0',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 08:30:36.865000','4224aa735f4949f2a11d85a5d97891b3'),('fc4be06f9d454f92b6af9c9586ab92c2','You are writing a blog post about the benefits of gardening. Which of the following would be a suitable question-based introduction?','mcq','[\"\\\"Do you enjoy spending time outdoors?\\\"\", \"\\\"Gardening is a rewarding hobby, isn\'t it?\\\"\", \"\\\"Have you ever considered the positive impact gardening can have on your well-being?\\\"\", \"\\\"What tools do you need to start a garden?\\\"\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 13:04:12.973000','e34c570c0e0748769fcb5ff5a344bef8'),('fc5cd74ab1b14933b231e3f71d86d78e','Which data structure is particularly well-suited for representing relationships between entities?','mcq','[\"Array\", \"Linked List\", \"Graph\", \"Trie\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-23 10:03:17.432000','e1de9d36952e422885e3f8cd84f5e660'),('fccff4abd2934d71b9bb16247ee86694','What type of differential equation is the logistic growth model, $dP/dt = rP(1 - P/K)$?','mcq','[\"Second-order linear\", \"First-order linear\", \"First-order separable\", \"Second-order non-linear\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-25 13:40:19.958000','40a489946c0b4bf7802b8f631060302c'),('fcf3a40b70504fd5ab0326206e40fcfa','What does the \"A\" in \"CAH\" represent in the mnemonic SOH CAH TOA?','mcq','[\"Angle\", \"Adjacent\", \"Altitude\", \"Apex\"]','1',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-23 06:16:19.362000','60f24830189145498064d7f46d832bbe'),('fd02d8b48e5f4f39897f048d18df9689','Which of the following best describes the concept of an \"index\" in the context of arrays?','mcq','[\"The data type of the elements stored in the array.\", \"The total number of elements the array can hold.\", \"The numerical position of an element within the array, starting from 0.\", \"The value of a specific element in the array.\"]','2',NUL