a648d4321d7cbf5c','In Python, what is the primary purpose of a variable?','mcq','[\"To define a new function in the program.\", \"To store and manage data by giving a name to a value.\", \"To execute a block of code repeatedly.\", \"To declare the type of data a value will hold before assignment.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-08 17:16:38.111000','9cd0f04a76c145e783f5a5d9d16b9166'),('fdcf8f62a35544c3ba66f1cc94ee0fc6','In the provided BFS code example, what is the purpose of the `deque` data structure?','mcq','[\"To store the graph\'s adjacency list.\", \"To maintain the order of visited nodes.\", \"To implement the First-In, First-Out (FIFO) queue for node exploration.\", \"To store the edges of the graph.\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-23 10:03:17.437000','e1de9d36952e422885e3f8cd84f5e660'),('fe4a123e1b0a4916b6b85cb7b4eee3df','In a right-angled triangle, which side is always opposite the right angle?','mcq','[\"Adjacent\", \"Opposite\", \"Hypotenuse\", \"Base\"]','2',NULL,1,3,'2025-09-22 16:29:52.963000','bae46a26221c4967826fca4d0322be46'),('fe6b5b9a158041a48e19561a37016490','What is an equation in algebra?','mcq','[\"A mathematical statement that shows two expressions are equal\", \"A symbol that represents an unknown value\", \"A method for solving for an unknown value\", \"A set of numbers and variables\"]','0',NULL,1,4,'2025-09-22 16:15:26.920000','f3d61f8841654816a79fa1e5db46c1b3'),('feae4910edfd46dba8a9920f6a687292','Which unit of measurement, besides degrees, is commonly used to express angles?','mcq','[\"Meters\", \"Radians\", \"Grams\", \"Liters\"]','1',NULL,1,2,'2025-09-25 17:50:02.026000','fe4efbc6863140e78ee5a58caeec2300'),('fee9f6619f14446a8d601e553f26f559','Which of the following derivatives would you *not* expect to see as the highest order in a First-Order Ordinary Differential Equation?','mcq','[\"dy/dx\", \"y\'\", \"d^2y/dx^2\", \"df/dt\"]','2',NULL,1,4,'2025-10-10 04:47:17.187000','12ccb3a0ccfa41d689a7f515d7cb1db7'),('ff220fff076d4d1694bf6179c258fb8c','Which dimensionality reduction technique finds new variables (principal components) that capture the maximum variance in the data?','mcq','[\"t-SNE\", \"K-Means\", \"PCA\", \"Hierarchical Clustering\"]','2',NULL,1,5,'2025-09-22 15:06:39.291000','90ad7864ca6b4b1db6ff1b8dc1f96401'),('ffcac990bb314c47a7fbfd71ef23c3a0','In a right triangle, what is the name given to the side directly opposite the 90-degree angle?','mcq','[\"Adjacent side\", \"Leg\", \"Hypotenuse\", \"Opposite side\"]','2',NULL,1,2,'2025-10-07 05:26:23.200000','7e79ee02067c4d7184d89acf0869ffd2'),('ffdbc0d0dca24ebaa884d669ce7214ab','According to the text, what is the primary purpose of using Laplace Transforms for solving Differential Equations (DEs)?','mcq','[\"To make DEs more complex by introducing new variables.\", \"To convert challenging calculus problems into simpler algebra problems.\", \"To eliminate the need for any mathematical operations.\", \"To only solve DEs that do not involve derivatives.\"]','1',NULL,1,1,'2025-10-10 04:49:32.298000','797521c1138642a0a35fe358c1ac2db5');
