gles and sides that make them. We can use trigonometry to find missing information about triangles, such as how ...',3,'2025-09-22 17:00:02.418000','9afa1a193eae43b7a0ea5445dbd946b1'),('fd00a0f4c02b436db970992e5e056a41','Trigonometry | Khan Academy','Course','https://www.khanacademy.org/math/trigonometry','Trigonometric ratios review · The reciprocal trigonometric ratios · Community questions. Our mission is to provide a free, world-class education to anyone ...',1,'2025-09-25 14:05:47.908000','54957642a32b4613a47f455c32225581'),('fd2ccbee27e243f1bfb07eaf1ec0e24c','Python - Recursion','Documentation','https://www.tutorialspoint.com/python/python_recursion.htm','Recursion is a fundamental programming concept where a function calls itself in order to solve a problem. This technique breaks down a complex problem into ...',7,'2025-09-22 13:38:42.674000','5f5d663ebc1c41a09d5358077451ffb4'),('fd4b982673734074b92f63482c997e8f','The Surface of Things | National Geographic','Resource','https://www.nationalgeographic.com/science/article/the-surface-of-things','Mar 17, 2008 ... Both these tattoos are closely related to the research I\'ve done for my Ph.D., which is in the area of elliptic partial differential equations.',7,'2025-09-25 14:40:13.319000','ad2be0dcf7d94ee1b8fb2be027ab6e3c'),('fd76aa8471d74099945f1c9898b2e7b1','C++ Arrays (With Examples)','Resource','https://www.programiz.com/cpp-programming/arrays','In C++, an array is a variable that can store multiple values of the same type. In this tutorial, we will learn to work with arrays in C++ with the help of ...',7,'2025-10-07 21:45:40.254000','42447b7afa794ff6a1424bf01b8f1404'),('fdc56747175d400f84084fab83dc0a62','Solving systems of linear equations: medium (practice) | Khan ...','Course','https://www.khanacademy.org/test-prep/v2-sat-math/x0fcc98a58ba3bea7:algebra-medium/x0fcc98a58ba3bea7:solving-systems-of-linear-equations-medium/e/v2-solving-systems-of-linear-equations-2','Consider the system of equations. If ( y , z